(window.AFYA_TX=window.AFYA_TX||{})["hd"]={"hd_bp_arm":[["An automatic upper-arm monitor inflates the cuff, reads systolic and diastolic pressure and pulse, and is the type recommended by international hypertension guidelines for home use. Choose a model that has been clinically validated, has a cuff that fits the arm circumference (most standard cuffs cover 22–42 cm), and stores at least 30 readings so the doctor can see a pattern rather than one number. Measure seated, back supported, feet flat, arm resting at heart level, after five minutes of rest and with no tea, coffee or cigarette in the previous half hour; take two readings a minute apart, morning and evening, for seven days before a clinic visit. Wrist and finger devices are less reliable for most people, so the upper-arm model is the standard recommendation. In Tanzania about one adult in four aged 18–69 has high blood pressure and many do not know it, which makes a home monitor one of the most useful health purchases a family can make.","Mashine ya mkono wa juu otomatiki hujaza mkanda hewa, husoma shinikizo la juu na la chini pamoja na mapigo ya moyo, na ndiyo aina inayopendekezwa na miongozo ya kimataifa ya shinikizo la damu kwa matumizi ya nyumbani. Chagua mashine iliyothibitishwa kitabibu, yenye mkanda unaotosha mzunguko wa mkono (mikanda mingi ya kawaida ni sentimita 22–42), na inayohifadhi angalau vipimo 30 ili daktari aone mwenendo badala ya namba moja. Jipime ukiwa umeketi, mgongo umeegemea, miguu chini sakafuni, mkono umepumzika usawa wa moyo, baada ya kupumzika dakika tano na bila chai, kahawa wala sigara katika nusu saa iliyopita; pima mara mbili kwa tofauti ya dakika moja, asubuhi na jioni, kwa siku saba kabla ya kwenda kliniki. Mashine za kifundo cha mkono na za kidole si za kuaminika sana kwa watu wengi, kwa hiyo ya mkono wa juu ndiyo pendekezo la kawaida. Tanzania karibu mtu mzima mmoja kati ya wanne wenye umri wa miaka 18–69 ana shinikizo la juu la damu na wengi hawajui, hivyo mashine ya nyumbani ni mojawapo ya manunuzi ya afya yenye faida kubwa kwa familia."],["High-trust, high-ticket device that brings the family back for batteries, cuffs and logbooks","Kifaa cha bei ya juu kinachoaminika, kinachomrudisha mteja kununua betri, mikanda na madaftari"]],"hd_bp_plus":[["This step-up monitor adds features that matter once blood pressure is being treated: larger memory (often 60–120 readings), averaging of morning and evening values, two user profiles and an irregular-heartbeat symbol. The average function is useful because doctors decide on medicine changes from the mean of a week of home readings, not from a single high value. Look for a wide-range cuff, a large back-lit display for weaker eyesight, and an AC-adapter socket for households that measure twice a day. The irregular-heartbeat symbol is a prompt to see a clinician, not a diagnosis, and readings taken during an irregular rhythm should be repeated. Afya stocks this tier for customers who have outgrown a basic monitor or are buying for an elderly parent.","Mashine hii ya kiwango cha juu ina vipengele vinavyohitajika pale shinikizo linapotibiwa: kumbukumbu kubwa (mara nyingi vipimo 60–120), wastani wa vipimo vya asubuhi na jioni, watumiaji wawili na alama ya mapigo ya moyo yasiyo ya kawaida. Kipengele cha wastani ni muhimu kwa sababu daktari hubadilisha dawa kwa kuangalia wastani wa vipimo vya wiki nzima nyumbani, si kipimo kimoja kilichopanda. Tafuta mkanda mpana unaotosha mikono mingi, skrini kubwa yenye mwanga kwa wenye macho dhaifu, na tundu la adapta ya umeme kwa familia zinazopima mara mbili kwa siku. Alama ya mapigo yasiyo ya kawaida ni ishara ya kumwona mtaalamu wa afya, si uchunguzi kamili, na kipimo kilichochukuliwa wakati mapigo hayako sawa kirudiwe. Afya inauza kiwango hiki kwa wateja waliozidi mashine ya kawaida au wanaomnunulia mzazi mzee."],["Premium upgrade with strong gifting appeal for adult children buying for parents","Toleo la hadhi ya juu linalovutia kama zawadi kwa watoto wanaowanunulia wazazi"]],"hd_bp_afib":[["Atrial fibrillation is an irregular heart rhythm that raises the risk of stroke about five-fold and often causes no symptoms. Monitors with AFib screening take three readings in a row and analyse the pulse pattern, showing a specific symbol when the rhythm suggests AFib; several of these devices have been evaluated for screening during routine blood-pressure checks. The device still works as a full, validated blood-pressure monitor, so one purchase covers both needs. A positive AFib symbol should always be confirmed with an ECG at a clinic; a negative result does not rule out heart disease. Afya stocks this specialist model because stroke is a leading cause of disability in Tanzanian older adults and early detection changes treatment.","Mapigo ya moyo yasiyo ya mpangilio (AFib) ni hali inayoongeza hatari ya kiharusi takriban mara tano na mara nyingi haina dalili. Mashine zenye uchunguzi wa AFib huchukua vipimo vitatu mfululizo na kuchambua mpangilio wa mapigo, kisha huonyesha alama maalum pale mpangilio unapoashiria AFib; baadhi ya mashine hizi zimefanyiwa tathmini kwa uchunguzi wakati wa kupima shinikizo kwa kawaida. Mashine bado ni kipima shinikizo kamili kilichothibitishwa, kwa hiyo ununuzi mmoja unatosheleza mahitaji yote mawili. Alama ya AFib ikitokea lazima ithibitishwe kwa kipimo cha ECG kliniki; kukosekana kwa alama hakumaanishi hakuna ugonjwa wa moyo. Afya inauza mashine hii maalum kwa sababu kiharusi ni chanzo kikuu cha ulemavu kwa wazee Tanzania na kugundua mapema hubadilisha matibabu."],["Specialist, high-margin device that positions Afya as the expert heart-care counter","Kifaa maalum chenye faida kubwa kinachoifanya Afya kuwa kaunta ya kitaalamu ya moyo"]],"hd_bp_wrist":[["A wrist monitor is small, light and easy to put on with one hand, which makes it useful for travel and for people who cannot fit or manage an arm cuff. Its weakness is position: the wrist must be held exactly at heart level, palm up and still, or the reading can be several points too high or too low. Choose a model with a position-guide indicator and clinical validation, and compare it once against an upper-arm reading at a clinic to confirm it matches. Use the same wrist each time, rest five minutes first, and record the time of day with each reading. Afya stocks wrist monitors as a second option, while advising most first-time buyers to start with an upper-arm model.","Mashine ya kifundo cha mkono ni ndogo, nyepesi na rahisi kuvaa kwa mkono mmoja, hivyo inafaa kwa safari na kwa watu wasioweza kuvaa au kutumia mkanda wa mkono wa juu. Udhaifu wake ni mkao: kifundo lazima kiwe sawa kabisa na moyo, kiganja juu na kitulie, la sivyo kipimo kinaweza kuwa juu au chini kwa pointi kadhaa. Chagua mashine yenye kiashiria cha mkao sahihi na iliyothibitishwa kitabibu, na ilinganishe mara moja na kipimo cha mkono wa juu kliniki kuhakikisha zinalingana. Tumia kifundo kilekile kila mara, pumzika dakika tano kwanza, na andika saa ya kila kipimo. Afya inauza mashine za kifundo kama chaguo la pili, huku ikiwashauri wanunuzi wengi wa mara ya kwanza waanze na ya mkono wa juu."],["Solves a real fit problem for larger arms and adds a portable price point","Inatatua tatizo halisi la mkanda kwa mikono mikubwa na kuongeza bei ya kifaa cha kubeba"]],"hd_bp_cuff":[["A cuff that is too small for the arm is the single most common cause of falsely high blood-pressure readings, sometimes by 10 points or more. Measure the middle of the upper arm with a soft tape and choose a cuff whose printed range covers that number; large and wide-range cuffs fit arms up to about 42–52 cm. Replacement cuffs must match the brand and connector of the monitor, so bring the device or its model number when buying. Replace a cuff when the fabric frays, the Velcro stops holding or the air bladder leaks, typically every two to three years with daily use. Afya keeps the commonest cuffs in stock so a good monitor is not thrown away because of a worn part.","Mkanda mdogo kuliko mkono ndio chanzo kikubwa zaidi cha vipimo vya shinikizo vinavyoonyesha juu kimakosa, wakati mwingine kwa pointi 10 au zaidi. Pima katikati ya mkono wa juu kwa utepe laini wa kupimia na uchague mkanda ambao kipimo chake kilichoandikwa kinajumuisha namba hiyo; mikanda mikubwa na ya upana mpana hutosha mikono hadi takriban sentimita 42–52. Mkanda mbadala lazima ulingane na chapa na kiunganishi cha mashine, kwa hiyo leta mashine au namba ya modeli unaponunua. Badilisha mkanda pale kitambaa kinapochanika, gundi-ya-kushika (Velcro) inaposhindwa kushika au mfuko wa hewa unapovuja, kwa kawaida kila miaka miwili hadi mitatu kwa matumizi ya kila siku. Afya huweka mikanda inayotumika zaidi ili mashine nzuri isitupwe kwa sababu ya sehemu moja iliyochakaa."],["Accessory sale that protects reading accuracy and keeps monitor owners loyal","Mauzo ya kiambatanisho yanayolinda usahihi wa vipimo na kuwafanya wenye mashine kuwa waaminifu"]],"hd_bp_batt":[["Most home blood-pressure monitors run on four AA batteries, and weak batteries cause failed inflation, error codes and inaccurate low readings. Alkaline cells are the right choice: they deliver steady voltage for the motor and last roughly 250–300 measurements in a typical monitor. Replace all four together, never mix old and new or different brands, and remove batteries if the device will not be used for a month to prevent leakage in humid coastal air. A household measuring twice daily will use a set about every three to four months. Afya places batteries next to the monitors so a customer never leaves with a device that cannot be used that evening.","Mashine nyingi za shinikizo la damu za nyumbani hutumia betri nne za AA, na betri dhaifu husababisha mkanda kushindwa kujaa, alama za hitilafu na vipimo vya chini visivyo sahihi. Betri za alkalini ndizo sahihi: hutoa nguvu thabiti kwa mota na hudumu takriban vipimo 250–300 kwenye mashine ya kawaida. Badilisha zote nne kwa pamoja, usichanganye za zamani na mpya au chapa tofauti, na ondoa betri kama mashine haitatumika kwa mwezi mmoja ili zisivuje kwenye hewa yenye unyevu wa pwani. Familia inayopima mara mbili kwa siku hutumia seti moja kila miezi mitatu hadi minne. Afya huweka betri karibu na mashine ili mteja asiondoke na kifaa ambacho hakiwezi kutumika jioni hiyo."],["Cheap, repeat add-on with near-certain attachment to every device sale","Nyongeza ya bei nafuu inayorudiwa na karibu kila mauzo ya kifaa"]],"hd_bp_log":[["A written record turns home readings into information a clinician can act on: date, time, reading, medicine taken and anything unusual such as illness, a missed dose or a salty meal. A sturdy A5 book survives the clinic bag and is easy for older eyes; rule columns once at the front and keep one page per week. Doctors adjust blood-pressure treatment from the average of seven days of morning and evening readings, and adjust diabetes treatment from patterns in fasting and after-meal sugar, so a complete logbook can save a wasted visit. Paper also works when phone batteries die or apps are lost. Afya sells logbooks with every monitor and meter because the habit of recording is what makes the device useful.","Kumbukumbu iliyoandikwa hugeuza vipimo vya nyumbani kuwa taarifa ambayo mtaalamu wa afya anaweza kuzitumia: tarehe, saa, kipimo, dawa iliyotumika na jambo lolote lisilo la kawaida kama ugonjwa, dozi iliyorukwa au chakula chenye chumvi nyingi. Daftari imara la A5 hustahimili mkoba wa kliniki na ni rahisi kwa macho ya wazee; chora safu mara moja mwanzoni na tumia ukurasa mmoja kwa wiki. Daktari hubadilisha matibabu ya shinikizo kwa kuangalia wastani wa siku saba za vipimo vya asubuhi na jioni, na hubadilisha matibabu ya kisukari kwa mwenendo wa sukari ya kufunga na baada ya kula, hivyo daftari kamili linaweza kuzuia safari ya kliniki isiyo na matokeo. Karatasi pia hufanya kazi pale betri ya simu inapoisha au programu inapopotea. Afya huuza madaftari pamoja na kila mashine kwa sababu tabia ya kuandika ndiyo inayofanya kifaa kiwe na manufaa."],["Low-cost add-on that builds the monitoring habit and future strip and battery sales","Nyongeza ya bei nafuu inayojenga tabia ya kujipima na mauzo ya baadaye ya vipande na betri"]],"hd_glu_meter_v":[["A starter kit contains the meter, a lancing device, a few lancets and strips, so testing can begin the same day. For a value kit the real cost is not the meter but the strips, so choose a system whose strips are reliably stocked in Tanzania at a price the household can sustain every month. Check that the meter meets the ISO 15197 accuracy standard, is code-free, needs a small blood drop and shows results in mmol/L, the unit used in Tanzanian clinics. People on tablets alone typically test a few times a week, alternating fasting and two hours after a meal, which uses about 25 strips a month. Afya stocks a value kit because affordability is the main reason people stop testing.","Kifurushi cha kuanzia kina mashine, kifaa cha kuchoma kidole, sindano ndogo chache na vipande vya kupimia, ili kupima kuanze siku hiyohiyo. Kwa kifurushi cha bei nafuu gharama halisi si mashine bali vipande, kwa hiyo chagua mfumo ambao vipande vyake vinapatikana Tanzania muda wote kwa bei ambayo familia inaweza kumudu kila mwezi. Hakikisha mashine inakidhi kiwango cha usahihi cha ISO 15197, haihitaji kuweka namba ya msimbo, inahitaji tone dogo la damu na inaonyesha matokeo kwa mmol/L, kipimo kinachotumika kliniki za Tanzania. Watu wanaotumia vidonge pekee kwa kawaida hupima mara chache kwa wiki, wakibadilisha kati ya kufunga na saa mbili baada ya kula, ambayo ni takriban vipande 25 kwa mwezi. Afya inauza kifurushi cha bei nafuu kwa sababu gharama ndiyo sababu kubwa ya watu kuacha kupima."],["Entry price that opens a monthly strip relationship with most diabetes customers","Bei ya kuingilia inayofungua uhusiano wa kila mwezi wa vipande na wateja wengi wa kisukari"]],"hd_glu_meter_b":[["International-brand meters offer tighter accuracy, faster results, larger memories with 7-, 14- and 30-day averages, and in some cases colour-range indicators that show at a glance whether a result is low, in range or high. These features matter most for people on insulin, who test before meals and at bedtime and use the numbers to adjust doses. Strips cost more, so confirm the monthly strip budget before buying; a person testing four times a day uses about 120 strips a month. Store the meter and strips below 30 °C and away from humidity, and run a control check if results do not match how you feel. Afya stocks several leading systems so customers can stay with the brand their clinic trained them on.","Mashine za chapa za kimataifa zina usahihi zaidi, matokeo ya haraka, kumbukumbu kubwa zenye wastani wa siku 7, 14 na 30, na baadhi zina viashiria vya rangi vinavyoonyesha papo hapo kama matokeo ni chini, sawa au juu. Vipengele hivi ni muhimu zaidi kwa wanaotumia insulini, ambao hupima kabla ya milo na kabla ya kulala na kutumia namba hizo kurekebisha dozi. Vipande ni ghali zaidi, kwa hiyo hakikisha bajeti ya vipande ya kila mwezi kabla ya kununua; mtu anayepima mara nne kwa siku hutumia takriban vipande 120 kwa mwezi. Hifadhi mashine na vipande chini ya nyuzi joto 30 na mbali na unyevu, na fanya kipimo cha uhakiki ikiwa matokeo hayaendani na unavyojisikia. Afya inauza mifumo kadhaa inayoongoza ili wateja wabaki na chapa waliyofundishwa kliniki."],["Brand-loyal customers who buy high-value strips every month","Wateja waaminifu kwa chapa wanaonunua vipande vya thamani kubwa kila mwezi"]],"hd_glu_cgm":[["A CGM is a small sensor worn on the back of the arm or abdomen with a fine filament under the skin that reads glucose every few minutes for up to two weeks, sending results to a phone or reader. It shows trends and overnight lows that finger-prick tests miss, and international diabetes standards now recommend CGM for people on insulin. Check phone compatibility, wear time, whether alarms are included and the monthly cost of replacement sensors before committing. Readings lag blood by about 10–15 minutes, so a finger-prick test is still needed to confirm a suspected hypo or when symptoms do not match the number. Afya stocks CGM as a specialist line, with staff trained to explain setup and care.","CGM ni kihisi kidogo kinachovaliwa nyuma ya mkono au tumboni chenye uzi mwembamba chini ya ngozi unaosoma sukari kila baada ya dakika chache kwa hadi wiki mbili, na kutuma matokeo kwenye simu au kisomaji. Huonyesha mwenendo na sukari kushuka usiku ambavyo vipimo vya kuchoma kidole hukosa, na viwango vya kimataifa vya kisukari sasa vinapendekeza CGM kwa wanaotumia insulini. Kabla ya kuanza, hakikisha inaendana na simu yako, muda wa kuvaa, kama ina kengele za tahadhari na gharama ya kila mwezi ya vihisi mbadala. Vipimo vyake huchelewa takriban dakika 10–15 nyuma ya damu, kwa hiyo kipimo cha kidole bado kinahitajika kuthibitisha sukari kushuka au pale dalili haziendani na namba. Afya inauza CGM kama bidhaa maalum, na wafanyakazi waliofundishwa kueleza jinsi ya kuiweka na kuitunza."],["High-value specialist item that attracts engaged, recurring insulin users","Bidhaa maalum ya thamani kubwa inayovutia watumiaji wa insulini wanaorudi mara kwa mara"]],"hd_glu_strip_v":[["Test strips are the consumable that makes a glucose meter work, and each strip fits only its own meter system. Always check the expiry date and use the strips within the period printed on the tube after opening, often three to six months, because exposure to humid air degrades the enzyme and gives false results. Close the tube immediately after taking a strip, keep it in its original container, and never cut or reuse strips. A person testing three times a week uses about 12–15 strips a month; daily testing needs 30 or more. Afya keeps the value systems in deep stock so customers never have to change meters because strips ran out.","Vipande vya kupimia ni bidhaa inayotumika na kuisha inayofanya mashine ya sukari ifanye kazi, na kila kipande kinatumika na mfumo wake tu wa mashine. Daima angalia tarehe ya kuisha muda na tumia vipande ndani ya kipindi kilichoandikwa kwenye kopo baada ya kulifungua, mara nyingi miezi mitatu hadi sita, kwa sababu hewa yenye unyevu huharibu kemikali na kutoa matokeo yasiyo sahihi. Funga kopo mara tu unapotoa kipande, kiweke kwenye chombo chake halisi, na kamwe usikate wala kutumia tena kipande. Mtu anayepima mara tatu kwa wiki hutumia takriban vipande 12–15 kwa mwezi; kupima kila siku kunahitaji 30 au zaidi. Afya huweka akiba kubwa ya mifumo ya bei nafuu ili wateja wasilazimike kubadili mashine kwa sababu vipande vimeisha."],["The single most repeat-purchased diabetes item, ideal for Afya Box subscriptions","Bidhaa ya kisukari inayonunuliwa tena zaidi, inafaa kabisa kwa usajili wa Afya Box"]],"hd_glu_strip_b":[["Branded strips are matched to their meters and generally achieve tighter accuracy at low glucose levels, which is where precision matters most for insulin users. Buy the exact strip name printed on your meter; similar-looking strips from the same brand often do not fit or read correctly. Store below 30 °C away from bathroom steam and direct sun, and note the date of opening on the tube. People on several insulin injections a day typically need 100–150 strips a month, so a 50-strip pack is best bought in multiples or through a subscription. Afya offers these as part of the monthly Afya Box so supply is never interrupted.","Vipande vya chapa vimeoanishwa na mashine zake na kwa kawaida vina usahihi zaidi sukari ikiwa chini, ambapo usahihi ni muhimu zaidi kwa wanaotumia insulini. Nunua jina halisi la kipande lililoandikwa kwenye mashine yako; vipande vinavyofanana vya chapa hiyohiyo mara nyingi haviingii au havisomi sawasawa. Hifadhi chini ya nyuzi joto 30 mbali na mvuke wa bafuni na jua kali, na andika tarehe ya kufungua kwenye kopo. Wanaodunga insulini mara kadhaa kwa siku kwa kawaida huhitaji vipande 100–150 kwa mwezi, kwa hiyo pakiti ya vipande 50 inafaa kununuliwa kadhaa kwa pamoja au kwa usajili. Afya inavitoa kama sehemu ya Afya Box ya kila mwezi ili upatikanaji usikatike."],["High-value monthly repeat from the most engaged diabetes customers","Mauzo ya kila mwezi ya thamani kubwa kutoka kwa wateja wa kisukari walio makini zaidi"]],"hd_glu_lan_u":[["Universal lancets fit most pen-style lancing devices and are sterile, single-use needles that make the small finger prick for a glucose test. Finer gauges (30–33G) hurt less; check that the cap style matches your device before buying a large box. Use a new lancet for every test: a reused lancet is blunt, more painful and can carry infection, and lancets should never be shared even within a family. Prick the side of the fingertip rather than the pad, rotate fingers, and drop used lancets into a sharps box. Afya stocks boxes of 100 at a low price so there is never a reason to reuse.","Sindano ndogo za matumizi yote huingia kwenye vifaa vingi vya kuchoma kidole vyenye umbo la kalamu, na ni sindano safi zisizo na vijidudu za kutumia mara moja kwa kuchoma kidole kidogo kwa ajili ya kupima sukari. Sindano nyembamba zaidi (30–33G) huuma kidogo; hakikisha aina ya kifuniko inaendana na kifaa chako kabla ya kununua boksi kubwa. Tumia sindano mpya kwa kila kipimo: sindano iliyotumika imekwisha makali, inauma zaidi na inaweza kubeba maambukizi, na sindano hizi zisishirikiwe hata ndani ya familia. Choma upande wa ncha ya kidole badala ya katikati, badilisha vidole, na tupa sindano zilizotumika kwenye kisanduku cha vitu vyenye ncha kali. Afya inauza boksi za 100 kwa bei ndogo ili kusiwe na sababu ya kutumia tena."],["Cheap essential bought alongside every strip pack","Hitaji muhimu la bei nafuu linalonunuliwa pamoja na kila pakiti ya vipande"]],"hd_glu_lan_b":[["Several branded lancing devices use a proprietary lancet shape that universal lancets do not fit. These lancets are often very fine and precision-ground, and the devices offer depth settings, which together make testing noticeably less painful for people who test four or more times a day. Check the name on your lancing device and buy the matching lancet. A new lancet each time keeps the tip sharp and sterile; one box of 100–200 lasts a month to several months depending on how often you test. Afya keeps these alongside the matching strips so a branded-system user can buy everything in one stop.","Vifaa kadhaa vya chapa vya kuchoma kidole hutumia sindano zenye umbo maalum ambalo sindano za matumizi yote haziingii. Sindano hizi mara nyingi ni nyembamba sana na zimenolewa kwa ustadi, na vifaa hivi vina kipimo cha kina cha kuchoma, mambo ambayo kwa pamoja hufanya kupima kuume kidogo zaidi kwa wanaopima mara nne au zaidi kwa siku. Angalia jina kwenye kifaa chako cha kuchoma kidole na nunua sindano zinazolingana nacho. Sindano mpya kila mara huweka ncha kali na safi; boksi moja la 100–200 hudumu mwezi mmoja hadi miezi kadhaa kulingana na unavyopima mara ngapi. Afya inaziweka pamoja na vipande vinavyolingana ili mtumiaji wa mfumo wa chapa anunue kila kitu sehemu moja."],["Locks in branded-system users and lifts basket value","Huwafunga watumiaji wa mifumo ya chapa na kuongeza thamani ya kikapu"]],"hd_glu_alc":[["Individually sealed 70% isopropyl alcohol pads clean the skin or a vial stopper before an injection or test. For finger-prick testing, washing hands with soap and warm water and drying them is best, because sugar on the fingers from fruit or food gives falsely high results; if alcohol is used, let it dry fully, as wet alcohol dilutes the blood drop and stings. Pads are most useful when travelling, at work or for wiping the rubber top of an insulin vial. One pad per injection or test means a box of 100 lasts about a month for a regular insulin user. Afya stocks them as a low-cost companion to every insulin and testing purchase.","Vitambaa vya pombe ya isopropili asilimia 70 vilivyofungwa kimoja kimoja husafisha ngozi au kizibo cha chupa ya dawa kabla ya kudunga au kupima. Kwa kupima kwa kuchoma kidole, kunawa mikono kwa sabuni na maji ya uvuguvugu kisha kuikausha ni bora zaidi, kwa sababu sukari ya matunda au chakula iliyobaki vidoleni hutoa matokeo ya juu kimakosa; kama pombe itatumika, iache ikauke kabisa, kwa kuwa pombe mbichi hupunguza nguvu ya tone la damu na kuuma. Vitambaa hivi vinafaa zaidi wakati wa safari, kazini au kufuta kizibo cha mpira cha chupa ya insulini. Kitambaa kimoja kwa kila dungo au kipimo kinamaanisha boksi la 100 hudumu takriban mwezi mmoja kwa mtumiaji wa kawaida wa insulini. Afya inaviuza kama mwenzi wa bei nafuu wa kila ununuzi wa insulini na vipimo."],["Low-price, high-frequency add-on to insulin and testing baskets","Nyongeza ya bei ndogo inayonunuliwa mara kwa mara kwenye vikapu vya insulini na vipimo"]],"hd_glu_cw":[["A small piece of clean absorbent cotton pressed on the finger for a few seconds stops bleeding after a glucose test and keeps blood off clothes and the meter. Choose pure absorbent cotton in a sealed pack and keep it in a clean, dry container, taking out only what you need so the rest stays clean. Do not use cotton wool to clean the finger before testing, and do not wipe the first drop with it unless your meter instructions say so. A 100 g roll lasts a daily tester several months. Afya stocks small and large packs so cotton is always on hand next to the meter.","Kipande kidogo cha pamba safi ya kufyonza kikibonyezwa kidoleni kwa sekunde chache husimamisha damu baada ya kupima sukari na huzuia damu kuchafua nguo na mashine. Chagua pamba halisi ya kufyonza kwenye pakiti iliyofungwa na uihifadhi kwenye chombo safi na kikavu, ukitoa unachohitaji tu ili iliyobaki ibaki safi. Usitumie pamba kusafisha kidole kabla ya kupima, wala usifute tone la kwanza kwa pamba isipokuwa maelekezo ya mashine yako yanasema hivyo. Roli ya gramu 100 hudumu miezi kadhaa kwa anayepima kila siku. Afya inauza pakiti ndogo na kubwa ili pamba iwe karibu na mashine wakati wote."],["Everyday staple that fills out testing and wound-care baskets","Hitaji la kila siku linalokamilisha vikapu vya vipimo na utunzaji wa vidonda"]],"hd_hypo_tab":[["Hypoglycaemia, a blood sugar below 4 mmol/L, causes shaking, sweating, confusion and, if untreated, loss of consciousness. The recommended treatment is 15 g of fast glucose, rechecking after 15 minutes and repeating if still low, then eating a snack with starch once recovered. Glucose tablets give an exact, measured dose (usually 3–4 g per tablet), act faster than chocolate or biscuits because they contain no fat, and do not melt in the heat of Dar es Salaam the way sweets do. Keep one roll in the bag, one at the bedside and one in the car, and teach family members where they are. Afya stocks glucose tablets at the testing counter because every insulin user should have them, especially during Ramadan fasting.","Sukari kushuka (hypoglycaemia), yaani sukari ya damu chini ya 4 mmol/L, husababisha kutetemeka, kutokwa jasho, kuchanganyikiwa na, isipotibiwa, kupoteza fahamu. Tiba inayopendekezwa ni gramu 15 za glukosi ya haraka, kupima tena baada ya dakika 15 na kurudia kama bado iko chini, kisha kula kitafunwa chenye wanga baada ya kupona. Vidonge vya glukosi hutoa dozi kamili iliyopimwa (kwa kawaida gramu 3–4 kwa kidonge), hufanya kazi haraka kuliko chokoleti au biskuti kwa sababu havina mafuta, na haviyeyuki kwenye joto la Dar es Salaam kama pipi. Weka roli moja mkobani, moja kando ya kitanda na moja garini, na waonyeshe wanafamilia zilipo. Afya inaviuza kwenye kaunta ya vipimo kwa sababu kila mtumiaji wa insulini anapaswa kuwa navyo, hasa wakati wa kufunga Ramadhani."],["Low-cost safety item with strong repeat and impulse purchase at the counter","Bidhaa ya usalama ya bei nafuu inayonunuliwa tena na kwa ghafla kaunta"]],"hd_hypo_pow":[["Pure glucose powder dissolved in water is a cheap, fast and reliable way to treat low blood sugar at home: about three level teaspoons (15 g) in half a glass of water. It is absorbed faster than table sugar and the dose is easy to measure with a kitchen spoon. Never give food or drink to someone who is unconscious or cannot swallow safely; place them on their side and seek emergency help. After the sugar works, follow with a starchy snack such as bread or uji to prevent the level dropping again. Afya stocks the powder as a household complement to tablets that are carried outside the home.","Unga safi wa glukosi uliochanganywa na maji ni njia rahisi, ya haraka na ya kuaminika ya kutibu sukari iliyoshuka nyumbani: takriban vijiko vitatu vya chai vilivyosawazishwa (gramu 15) kwenye nusu glasi ya maji. Hufyonzwa haraka kuliko sukari ya kawaida na dozi ni rahisi kupima kwa kijiko cha jikoni. Kamwe usimpe chakula wala kinywaji mtu aliyepoteza fahamu au asiyeweza kumeza salama; mlaze kwa ubavu na tafuta msaada wa dharura. Baada ya sukari kufanya kazi, fuatisha kwa kitafunwa chenye wanga kama mkate au uji ili kiwango kisishuke tena. Afya inauza unga huu kama nyongeza ya nyumbani kwa vidonge vinavyobebwa nje."],["Very low price point that completes the hypo kit and sells across the pharmacy","Bei ndogo sana inayokamilisha kifurushi cha sukari kushuka na huuzika kote dukani"]],"hd_hypo_ors":[["Illness with diarrhoea, vomiting or fever dehydrates the body quickly, pushes blood sugar up or down unpredictably, and can damage the kidneys of people on blood-pressure or diabetes medicines. WHO low-osmolarity ORS replaces water and salts in the right balance; dissolve one sachet in exactly the volume of clean water stated on the pack and sip it steadily. On sick days, test blood sugar more often, keep drinking, and ask a clinician whether any tablets, especially metformin, water pills or some blood-pressure medicines, should be paused until you are eating and drinking normally. Seek care urgently if vomiting continues, you cannot keep fluids down or sugar stays above 15 mmol/L. Afya includes ORS in every heart and diabetes sick-day kit, peaking in the rainy seasons.","Ugonjwa wenye kuharisha, kutapika au homa hupunguza maji mwilini haraka, husababisha sukari ya damu kupanda au kushuka bila mpangilio, na unaweza kuharibu figo za watu wanaotumia dawa za shinikizo au kisukari. ORS ya WHO yenye kiwango kidogo cha chumvi (low-osmolarity) hurudisha maji na chumvi kwa uwiano sahihi; yeyusha pakiti moja kwenye kiasi kamili cha maji safi kilichoandikwa kwenye pakiti na unywe taratibu muda wote. Siku za ugonjwa, pima sukari mara nyingi zaidi, endelea kunywa, na muulize mtaalamu wa afya kama vidonge fulani, hasa metformin, dawa za kukojoa au baadhi ya dawa za shinikizo, visimamishwe hadi utakapokula na kunywa kawaida. Tafuta huduma haraka kama kutapika kunaendelea, huwezi kubakiza vinywaji tumboni au sukari inabaki juu ya 15 mmol/L. Afya inaweka ORS katika kila kifurushi cha siku za ugonjwa cha moyo na kisukari, na mahitaji huongezeka wakati wa mvua."],["Cheap essential that builds trust through practical sick-day advice","Hitaji la bei nafuu linalojenga uaminifu kupitia ushauri wa vitendo wa siku za ugonjwa"]],"hd_ins_pn_s":[["Pen needles screw onto insulin pens; the 4 mm length is now recommended for nearly everyone because it reliably reaches the fat layer under the skin without risk of injecting into muscle, which speeds absorption and can cause hypos. Thinner gauges (31–32G) are more comfortable. Use a new needle for every injection: reused needles become blunt and bent, cause pain and bruising, and contribute to lipohypertrophy, the lumpy fatty patches that make insulin absorb unpredictably. Rotate sites around the abdomen and thighs, and drop used needles into a sharps container. A person injecting four times a day uses about 120 needles a month.","Sindano za kalamu hufungwa kwenye kalamu za insulini; urefu wa mm 4 sasa unapendekezwa kwa karibu kila mtu kwa sababu hufika kwenye tabaka la mafuta chini ya ngozi kwa uhakika bila hatari ya kudunga kwenye msuli, jambo ambalo huharakisha kufyonzwa na linaweza kusababisha sukari kushuka. Sindano nyembamba zaidi (31–32G) huuma kidogo. Tumia sindano mpya kwa kila dungo: sindano zilizotumika hupoteza makali na kupinda, husababisha maumivu na michubuko, na huchangia uvimbe wa mafuta chini ya ngozi (lipohypertrophy) unaofanya insulini ifyonzwe bila mpangilio. Badilisha sehemu za kudunga kuzunguka tumbo na mapaja, na tupa sindano zilizotumika kwenye kisanduku cha vitu vyenye ncha kali. Mtu anayedunga mara nne kwa siku hutumia takriban sindano 120 kwa mwezi."],["High-frequency monthly repeat with strong clinical reason to buy fresh","Bidhaa inayonunuliwa kila mwezi mara nyingi yenye sababu ya kitabibu ya kununua mpya"]],"hd_ins_pn_l":[["Longer 6–8 mm pen needles are still prescribed in some clinics and fit the same universal pen thread. With a longer needle, a skin pinch and a 45-degree angle may be needed in slimmer people to avoid injecting into muscle, so follow the technique your nurse demonstrated. If you are switching from 8 mm to 4 mm, discuss it at your next visit; the dose does not change, and most people find the shorter needle more comfortable. As with all pen needles, one needle per injection, never shared, and safe disposal in a sharps container. Afya stocks this length so customers can continue exactly what their clinic prescribed.","Sindano ndefu za mm 6–8 bado huandikwa na baadhi ya kliniki na huingia kwenye nyuzi zilezile za kalamu za kawaida. Kwa sindano ndefu, kubana ngozi na kudunga kwa pembe ya nyuzi 45 kunaweza kuhitajika kwa watu wembamba ili kuepuka kudunga kwenye msuli, kwa hiyo fuata mbinu aliyokuonyesha muuguzi. Kama unabadilisha kutoka mm 8 kwenda mm 4, jadili katika ziara yako ijayo; dozi haibadiliki, na watu wengi huona sindano fupi ni nzuri zaidi. Kama sindano zote za kalamu, sindano moja kwa dungo moja, kamwe isishirikiwe, na itupwe salama kwenye kisanduku cha vitu vyenye ncha kali. Afya inauza urefu huu ili wateja waendelee na kile hasa kliniki yao ilichoandika."],["Retains customers on existing clinic prescriptions with steady monthly demand","Inawabakiza wateja wanaofuata maagizo ya kliniki kwa mahitaji thabiti ya kila mwezi"]],"hd_ins_syr":[["Many Tanzanians receive insulin in 10 ml vials, which require a U-100 insulin syringe marked in units. The syringe size should match the dose: a 0.3 ml syringe for doses up to 30 units, 0.5 ml up to 50 units and 1 ml up to 100 units, so that each mark is easy to read. Choose fine, short attached needles (6–8 mm, 30–31G) and never use a general medical syringe marked in millilitres, which risks a dangerous dosing error. Use each syringe once, inject into the fat layer, and dispose of it in a sharps container. A person injecting twice a day needs around 60 syringes a month.","Watanzania wengi hupata insulini kwenye chupa za ml 10, ambazo zinahitaji sirinji ya insulini ya U-100 iliyowekwa alama kwa vipimo (units). Ukubwa wa sirinji unapaswa kulingana na dozi: sirinji ya ml 0.3 kwa dozi hadi vipimo 30, ml 0.5 hadi vipimo 50 na ml 1 hadi vipimo 100, ili kila alama isomeke kwa urahisi. Chagua sindano nyembamba na fupi zilizounganishwa (mm 6–8, 30–31G) na kamwe usitumie sirinji ya kawaida ya hospitali yenye alama za mililita, kwa kuwa ina hatari ya kosa la dozi la hatari. Tumia kila sirinji mara moja, dunga kwenye tabaka la mafuta, na itupe kwenye kisanduku cha vitu vyenye ncha kali. Mtu anayedunga mara mbili kwa siku huhitaji takriban sirinji 60 kwa mwezi."],["Core everyday need for the large vial-insulin population","Hitaji kuu la kila siku kwa idadi kubwa ya wanaotumia insulini ya chupa"]],"hd_ins_sharps":[["Used lancets and needles thrown loose in household rubbish injure family members, children and waste collectors and can transmit hepatitis B, hepatitis C and HIV. A proper sharps box is rigid, puncture-proof, has a narrow lockable opening and a fill line; drop sharps in point first and never push them down or recap needles by hand. When the box reaches the fill line, close it permanently and return it to a hospital or health facility that accepts sharps waste. A person using four pen needles and four lancets a day will fill a small box in about one to two months. Afya sells sharps boxes with every insulin starter purchase as a community safety commitment.","Sindano ndogo za kidole na sindano zilizotumika zikitupwa ovyo kwenye taka za nyumbani huumiza wanafamilia, watoto na wakusanyaji taka na zinaweza kuambukiza homa ya ini B, homa ya ini C na VVU. Kisanduku sahihi cha vitu vyenye ncha kali ni kigumu, hakitobolewi, kina mdomo mwembamba unaofungika na mstari wa kujaza; dumbukiza sindano ncha kwanza na kamwe usizisukume chini wala kufunika sindano tena kwa mkono. Kisanduku kikifika kwenye mstari wa kujaza, kifunge kabisa na kirudishe hospitalini au kituo cha afya kinachopokea taka za vitu vyenye ncha kali. Mtu anayetumia sindano nne za kalamu na sindano ndogo nne kwa siku hujaza kisanduku kidogo ndani ya mwezi mmoja hadi miwili. Afya inauza visanduku hivi pamoja na kila ununuzi wa kuanza insulini kama ahadi ya usalama wa jamii."],["Responsible-retail signature item with steady replacement demand","Bidhaa ya utambulisho wa biashara inayowajibika yenye mahitaji ya mara kwa mara ya kubadilisha"]],"hd_ins_cool":[["Insulin loses strength when it gets hotter than about 30 °C and is destroyed by freezing, which makes heat the main storage problem in coastal Tanzania. Unopened insulin is kept in the fridge door at 2–8 °C; the pen or vial in use can stay at room temperature for about four weeks if kept cool and out of the sun. A padded travel case with reusable ice packs keeps insulin cool for several hours on a bus or at work; always wrap ice packs so they never touch the insulin directly. Never leave insulin in a parked car or on a windowsill. Afya stocks cooling cases because protecting a month of insulin is worth far more than the case.","Insulini hupoteza nguvu inapopata joto zaidi ya takriban nyuzi joto 30 na huharibika ikiganda, jambo linalofanya joto kuwa tatizo kubwa la uhifadhi pwani ya Tanzania. Insulini isiyofunguliwa huwekwa kwenye mlango wa jokofu kwa nyuzi joto 2–8; kalamu au chupa inayotumika inaweza kukaa joto la kawaida la chumba kwa takriban wiki nne ikiwekwa sehemu ya baridi mbali na jua. Mkoba wenye pedi na mifuko ya barafu inayotumika tena huiweka insulini baridi kwa saa kadhaa ndani ya basi au kazini; daima funga mifuko ya barafu ili isiguse insulini moja kwa moja. Kamwe usiache insulini ndani ya gari lililoegeshwa au dirishani. Afya inauza mikoba hii kwa sababu kulinda insulini ya mwezi mzima kuna thamani kubwa kuliko mkoba wenyewe."],["Climate-specific problem solver with good margin and gifting appeal","Suluhisho la tatizo la hali ya hewa ya hapa lenye faida nzuri na mvuto wa zawadi"]],"hd_ins_ice":[["Gel ice packs frozen overnight and placed in a small insulated bag keep insulin and diabetes snacks cool through a working day in the heat. Wrap the frozen pack in a cloth so insulin is kept cool but never frozen, since frozen insulin must be discarded. The same bag carries a planned lunch, which helps people with diabetes avoid long gaps between meals or reliance on sugary street snacks. Have two sets of ice packs so one is always freezing. Afya stocks these as the low-cost refill and entry item for insulin cool storage.","Mifuko ya barafu ya jeli iliyogandishwa usiku na kuwekwa kwenye mkoba mdogo unaohifadhi baridi huweka insulini na vitafunwa vya kisukari baridi siku nzima ya kazi kwenye joto. Funga mfuko wa barafu kwa kitambaa ili insulini ibaki baridi lakini isigande kamwe, kwa kuwa insulini iliyoganda lazima itupwe. Mkoba huohuo hubeba chakula cha mchana kilichopangwa, kinachowasaidia wenye kisukari kuepuka muda mrefu bila kula au kutegemea vitafunwa vya mtaani vyenye sukari. Kuwa na seti mbili za mifuko ya barafu ili mmoja uwe unaganda muda wote. Afya inauza bidhaa hizi kama kujaza upya kwa bei nafuu na njia ya kuanza kuhifadhi insulini baridi."],["Affordable entry to cool storage that sells strongly in the hot season","Njia ya bei nafuu ya kuhifadhi baridi inayouzika sana msimu wa joto"]],"hd_ins_cbag":[["A larger cooler bag with several ice packs protects a household supply of insulin during power cuts and long road journeys, when the fridge cannot be relied on. Pack insulin in a sealed plastic box in the middle, surrounded by wrapped ice packs, and keep a simple fridge-style thermometer inside if possible. Replace ice packs every 12–24 hours and keep the bag in the coolest, shadiest room. Families also use it for medicines that must stay cool and for clean, safe drinking water on the road. Afya stocks the larger bag for customers planning holiday travel home in December.","Mkoba mkubwa wa baridi wenye mifuko kadhaa ya barafu hulinda akiba ya insulini ya familia wakati umeme unapokatika na safari ndefu za barabarani, pale jokofu haliwezi kutegemewa. Weka insulini kwenye kisanduku cha plastiki kilichofungwa katikati, ikizungukwa na mifuko ya barafu iliyofungwa kwa kitambaa, na kama inawezekana weka kipimajoto rahisi ndani. Badilisha mifuko ya barafu kila saa 12–24 na weka mkoba kwenye chumba chenye kivuli na baridi zaidi. Familia pia huutumia kwa dawa zinazopaswa kubaki baridi na kwa maji safi ya kunywa safarini. Afya inauza mkoba mkubwa kwa wateja wanaopanga safari za sikukuu kurudi nyumbani Desemba."],["Seasonal high-ticket item tied to December travel and power-cut worries","Bidhaa ya msimu ya bei ya juu inayohusiana na safari za Desemba na hofu ya kukatika umeme"]],"hd_foot_urea":[["Diabetes damages the nerves that control sweating, so the skin of the feet becomes very dry and cracks, and those cracks let in bacteria that cause serious infection. Creams with 10% urea attract and hold water in the skin and soften thickened areas, and international diabetic-foot guidelines recommend daily emollients for dry skin. Apply after washing and drying the feet, rubbing into the soles and heels but never between the toes, where moisture encourages fungal infection. A 100 ml tube used once daily lasts about a month. Afya stocks urea foot creams as the anchor of its diabetic foot-care bay.","Kisukari huharibu neva zinazodhibiti utokaji wa jasho, kwa hiyo ngozi ya miguu huwa kavu sana na kupasuka, na mipasuko hiyo huingiza bakteria wanaosababisha maambukizi makubwa. Krimu zenye urea asilimia 10 huvuta na kushika maji ndani ya ngozi na kulainisha sehemu zilizonenepa, na miongozo ya kimataifa ya miguu ya kisukari inapendekeza vilainishi kila siku kwa ngozi kavu. Paka baada ya kuosha na kukausha miguu, ukisugua nyayoni na visigino lakini kamwe katikati ya vidole, kwa kuwa unyevu pale huchochea maambukizi ya fangasi. Tyubu ya ml 100 ikitumika mara moja kwa siku hudumu takriban mwezi mmoja. Afya inauza krimu za urea kama kitovu cha sehemu yake ya utunzaji wa miguu ya kisukari."],["Monthly repeat with a clear medical reason and premium margin","Inanunuliwa kila mwezi kwa sababu ya wazi ya kitabibu na faida ya hadhi ya juu"]],"hd_foot_heel":[["Heel fissures are painful, can bleed, and in people with diabetes are a common entry point for foot ulcers. A thick balm forms a protective layer that seals moisture in overnight, and works best after a short soak and gentle smoothing of hard skin with a foot file. Apply at night and wear clean cotton socks to keep the balm in place and off the bedding. If a crack is bleeding, red, warm or oozing, stop home treatment and have it seen by a clinician the same week, because infection in a diabetic foot can progress fast. Afya stocks balms alongside urea creams as the intensive option for heels.","Mipasuko ya visigino inauma, inaweza kutoa damu, na kwa wenye kisukari ni njia ya kawaida ya kuanza kwa vidonda vya miguu. Mafuta mazito hutengeneza tabaka la kinga linalofungia unyevu usiku kucha, na hufanya kazi vizuri zaidi baada ya kuloweka miguu kwa muda mfupi na kulainisha ngozi ngumu kwa upole kwa jiwe au kisugulio cha miguu. Paka usiku na vaa soksi safi za pamba ili mafuta yabaki mahali pake na yasichafue matandiko. Kama mpasuko unatoa damu, una wekundu, joto au usaha, acha matibabu ya nyumbani na umwone mtaalamu wa afya ndani ya wiki hiyo, kwa sababu maambukizi kwenye mguu wa mwenye kisukari yanaweza kuenea haraka. Afya inauza mafuta haya pamoja na krimu za urea kama chaguo la nguvu zaidi kwa visigino."],["Visible problem with a satisfying result, driving word-of-mouth repeat","Tatizo linaloonekana lenye matokeo ya kuridhisha, linalochochea mauzo ya kurudiwa kwa mapendekezo"]],"hd_foot_sockd":[["Diabetic socks have flat or no toe seams, a loose top that does not leave a mark on the leg, and soft cushioning, so they do not rub a blister on a foot that cannot feel pain. Choose cotton-rich or moisture-wicking fabric in a light colour, which makes any blood or discharge from an unnoticed wound easy to see. Change socks daily, turn them inside out to check for stones or grit before wearing, and never wear socks with tight elastic that leaves a groove. They are not compression stockings and do not treat circulation problems. Afya stocks diabetic socks because preventing one foot ulcer saves far more than a lifetime of good socks.","Soksi za wenye kisukari hazina mshono mkubwa vidoleni au hazina kabisa, zina sehemu ya juu iliyolegea isiyoacha alama mguuni, na mto laini, ili zisichubue mguu usioweza kuhisi maumivu. Chagua kitambaa chenye pamba nyingi au kinachovuta unyevu, chenye rangi nyepesi, ambayo hufanya damu au usaha kutoka kwenye jeraha lisilogunduliwa kuonekana kwa urahisi. Badilisha soksi kila siku, zigeuze kuangalia kama kuna vijiwe au mchanga kabla ya kuvaa, na kamwe usivae soksi zenye mpira unaobana na kuacha mfereji mguuni. Hizi si soksi za kubana (compression) na hazitibu matatizo ya mzunguko wa damu. Afya inauza soksi hizi kwa sababu kuzuia kidonda kimoja cha mguu kunaokoa zaidi ya gharama ya soksi nzuri maisha yote."],["Recurring textile sale with a clear prevention story","Mauzo ya nguo yanayorudiwa yenye simulizi ya wazi ya kinga"]],"hd_foot_sockc":[["Wearing socks with shoes every day is one of the simplest foot-protection steps for people with diabetes, preventing direct friction and absorbing sweat. Plain cotton socks in white or light grey are an affordable everyday option; choose a size that fits without bunching and check that the top band is soft, cutting off any that leave deep marks. Multipacks make daily changes possible, which matters in the hot, humid climate where damp socks encourage fungal infections. Wash in hot water and dry fully in the sun. Afya stocks multipacks next to diabetic socks so every budget can follow the daily-sock rule.","Kuvaa soksi pamoja na viatu kila siku ni mojawapo ya hatua rahisi za kulinda miguu kwa wenye kisukari, kuzuia msuguano wa moja kwa moja na kufyonza jasho. Soksi za pamba za kawaida za rangi nyeupe au kijivu hafifu ni chaguo la bei nafuu kwa kila siku; chagua saizi inayotosha bila kujikunja na hakikisha mkanda wa juu ni laini, ukiacha zile zinazoacha alama za kina. Pakiti za jozi kadhaa zinawezesha kubadilisha kila siku, jambo muhimu katika hali ya joto na unyevu ambapo soksi zenye unyevu huchochea fangasi. Osha kwa maji ya moto na kausha kabisa juani. Afya inauza pakiti hizi kando ya soksi za kisukari ili kila bajeti iweze kufuata kanuni ya soksi kila siku."],["Low-price volume line that pulls budget customers into foot care","Bidhaa ya bei ndogo ya wingi inayowavuta wateja wa bajeti ndogo kwenye utunzaji wa miguu"]],"hd_foot_nail":[["Cutting toenails wrongly is a common cause of ingrown nails and small wounds that become diabetic foot infections. Cut nails straight across, not too short, and smooth sharp corners with a file rather than digging into the sides; cutting after a bath, when nails are softer, makes it easier. A clipper with a built-in magnifier or a wide, comfortable handle helps people who cannot see or reach their toes well. If nails are very thick, curved or ingrown, or if feet have lost feeling, nail care should be done by a trained health worker. Afya stocks good-quality stainless clippers because cheap blades tear rather than cut.","Kukata kucha za miguu vibaya ni chanzo cha kawaida cha kucha kuota ndani na majeraha madogo yanayogeuka kuwa maambukizi ya mguu wa kisukari. Kata kucha moja kwa moja, si fupi sana, na lainisha pembe kali kwa tupa badala ya kuchimba pembeni; kukata baada ya kuoga, kucha zikiwa laini, hurahisisha kazi. Kikata kucha chenye kioo cha kukuza au mpini mpana unaoshikika vizuri huwasaidia wasioweza kuona au kufikia vidole vyao vizuri. Kama kucha ni nene sana, zimepinda au zimeota ndani, au kama miguu imepoteza hisia, utunzaji wa kucha ufanywe na mtaalamu wa afya aliyefunzwa. Afya inauza vikata kucha vya chuma cha pua vya ubora kwa sababu vile vya bei rahisi huchana badala ya kukata."],["Small, durable tool with strong attach rate to foot creams and gifts for elders","Kifaa kidogo cha kudumu kinachonunuliwa pamoja na krimu za miguu na zawadi kwa wazee"]],"hd_foot_file":[["Thick callus raises pressure under the foot, and in people with diabetes bleeding under a callus is a warning sign of an ulcer forming beneath. A double-sided file used gently on damp skin two or three times a week keeps hard skin thin and lets creams work. Never use blades, razors, corn plasters with acid or hot stones on a diabetic foot, as these cause wounds that do not heal. Stop if the skin turns pink or sore, and have any callus that is dark, painful or bleeding checked by a clinician. Afya stocks simple files as part of a complete, safe home routine.","Sugu nene huongeza mgandamizo chini ya mguu, na kwa wenye kisukari damu chini ya sugu ni ishara ya tahadhari kwamba kidonda kinajitengeneza chini yake. Kisugulio cha pande mbili kikitumika kwa upole kwenye ngozi yenye unyevu mara mbili au tatu kwa wiki huiweka ngozi ngumu kuwa nyembamba na kuruhusu krimu kufanya kazi. Kamwe usitumie wembe, viwembe, plasta za sugu zenye asidi au mawe ya moto kwenye mguu wa mwenye kisukari, kwa kuwa husababisha majeraha yasiyopona. Acha ikiwa ngozi inakuwa ya waridi au inauma, na sugu yoyote iliyo nyeusi, inayouma au inayotoa damu ichunguzwe na mtaalamu wa afya. Afya inauza visugulio rahisi kama sehemu ya utaratibu kamili na salama wa nyumbani."],["Low-cost tool that drives cream usage and repeat foot-care visits","Kifaa cha bei ndogo kinachoongeza matumizi ya krimu na ziara za kurudia za utunzaji wa miguu"]],"hd_foot_lotion":[["High blood sugar and chronic kidney disease both dry the skin, and scratching dry, itchy skin creates small breaks that can become infected. A fragrance-free lotion with urea, glycerine or ceramides, applied within a few minutes of bathing, restores the skin barrier and reduces itch; studies in kidney patients show regular emollients improve uraemic dryness and itch. Choose a large pump bottle for whole-body daily use, which typically needs about 250–400 ml a month. Use lukewarm rather than hot water and a mild soap-free wash. Afya stocks a range from everyday to urea-based lotions so every customer can moisturise daily.","Sukari ya juu na ugonjwa sugu wa figo vyote hukausha ngozi, na kujikuna kwenye ngozi kavu inayowasha hutengeneza michubuko midogo inayoweza kupata maambukizi. Losheni isiyo na manukato yenye urea, glycerine au ceramides, ikipakwa ndani ya dakika chache baada ya kuoga, hurejesha kinga ya ngozi na kupunguza muwasho; tafiti kwa wagonjwa wa figo zinaonyesha vilainishi vya mara kwa mara hupunguza ukavu na muwasho unaotokana na figo. Chagua chupa kubwa ya kusukuma kwa matumizi ya mwili mzima kila siku, ambayo kwa kawaida huhitaji takriban ml 250–400 kwa mwezi. Tumia maji ya uvuguvugu badala ya moto na kisafishaji laini kisicho na sabuni kali. Afya inauza aina mbalimbali kuanzia za kila siku hadi zenye urea ili kila mteja aweze kulainisha ngozi kila siku."],["High-volume monthly basket item with a clinical upsell to urea formulas","Bidhaa ya wingi ya kila mwezi yenye fursa ya kupandisha hadi fomula za urea"]],"hd_foot_cream":[["A thick cream in a tub contains more oil than a lotion and forms a stronger barrier, which suits shins, elbows and hands that crack in dry weather or with diabetes. Look for fragrance-free formulas with ceramides, glycerine or petrolatum, which are well tolerated by sensitive skin. Apply to slightly damp skin after bathing and again at night on the worst areas; a 450 g tub lasts one person about two months. Avoid applying thick cream between the toes. Afya stocks barrier creams for customers who need more protection than a lotion gives.","Krimu nzito ya kwenye kopo ina mafuta mengi kuliko losheni na hutengeneza kinga imara zaidi, inayofaa kwa miundi, viwiko na mikono vinavyopasuka wakati wa ukavu au kwa sababu ya kisukari. Tafuta fomula zisizo na manukato zenye ceramides, glycerine au petrolatum, ambazo huvumiliwa vizuri na ngozi nyeti. Paka kwenye ngozi yenye unyevu kidogo baada ya kuoga na tena usiku kwenye sehemu zilizoathirika zaidi; kopo la gramu 450 humtosha mtu mmoja takriban miezi miwili. Epuka kupaka krimu nzito katikati ya vidole vya miguu. Afya inauza krimu hizi kwa wateja wanaohitaji kinga zaidi ya ile ya losheni."],["Premium dermatology brands that lift basket value and loyalty","Chapa za hadhi ya ngozi zinazoongeza thamani ya kikapu na uaminifu"]],"hd_foot_wash":[["Harsh bar soaps and antiseptic soaps strip natural oils from skin that is already dry, making cracks more likely. A soap-free or cream-rich bar cleans without raising skin pH as much, and is gentle enough for daily foot washing. Wash feet daily in lukewarm water, testing the temperature with the elbow or a thermometer rather than the feet, because nerve damage can hide a burn. Dry carefully, especially between the toes, before applying cream to the rest of the foot. Afya stocks gentle cleansers as the first step of its daily foot-care routine.","Sabuni kali za mche na sabuni za kuua vijidudu huondoa mafuta asilia kwenye ngozi ambayo tayari ni kavu, na kuongeza uwezekano wa mipasuko. Mche usio na sabuni kali au wenye krimu nyingi husafisha bila kupandisha sana kiwango cha pH cha ngozi, na ni laini kiasi cha kuoshea miguu kila siku. Osha miguu kila siku kwa maji ya uvuguvugu, ukipima joto kwa kiwiko au kipimajoto badala ya miguu, kwa sababu uharibifu wa neva unaweza kuficha kuungua. Kausha kwa uangalifu, hasa katikati ya vidole, kabla ya kupaka krimu kwenye sehemu nyingine ya mguu. Afya inauza visafishaji laini kama hatua ya kwanza ya utaratibu wake wa kila siku wa kutunza miguu."],["Everyday replenishment item that anchors the foot-care routine","Bidhaa ya kujaza kila siku inayoshikilia utaratibu wa kutunza miguu"]],"hd_foot_dress":[["Any break in the skin of a diabetic foot should be cleaned, covered and watched closely, because reduced feeling and circulation mean small wounds can become serious infections within days. Rinse with clean water or saline, apply a thin layer of mild antiseptic, and cover with sterile gauze held by tape that does not wrap tightly around the toe. Check and change the dressing daily, keep weight off the area, and see a clinician within 24–48 hours if the wound is not clearly improving, or immediately if there is spreading redness, swelling, smell, pus or fever. Do not burst blisters. Afya keeps sterile gauze in individual and bulk packs next to its foot-care range.","Mchubuko wowote kwenye ngozi ya mguu wa mwenye kisukari unapaswa kusafishwa, kufunikwa na kuangaliwa kwa karibu, kwa sababu kupungua kwa hisia na mzunguko wa damu kunamaanisha majeraha madogo yanaweza kugeuka maambukizi makubwa ndani ya siku chache. Suuza kwa maji safi au maji ya chumvi ya kitabibu (saline), paka tabaka jembamba la dawa laini ya kuua vijidudu, na funika kwa shashi safi iliyoshikiliwa na utepe usiozunguka kidole kwa kubana. Kagua na ubadilishe kifuniko kila siku, usikanyage kwa uzito sehemu hiyo, na mwone mtaalamu wa afya ndani ya saa 24–48 kama jeraha haliponi waziwazi, au mara moja kama kuna wekundu unaoenea, uvimbe, harufu, usaha au homa. Usipasue malengelenge. Afya huweka shashi safi za kimoja kimoja na za pakiti kubwa karibu na bidhaa za kutunza miguu."],["Protective essentials that position Afya as the safe first stop before the clinic","Mahitaji ya kinga yanayoiweka Afya kuwa kituo salama cha kwanza kabla ya kliniki"]],"hd_foot_hand":[["Frequent hand washing before glucose tests and repeated finger pricks leave fingertips dry, hardened and sore, which makes testing more painful. A non-greasy hand cream applied after testing, never before, keeps fingertips supple and helps prick sites heal. Choose a small tube that fits in a testing kit or handbag and a fragrance-light formula. Rotating fingers and pricking the sides rather than the pads also protects the fingertips. Afya stocks hand creams near the testing counter as a comfort add-on.","Kunawa mikono mara kwa mara kabla ya kupima sukari na kuchoma vidole kurudiwa huacha ncha za vidole kavu, ngumu na zenye maumivu, jambo linalofanya kupima kuume zaidi. Krimu ya mikono isiyo na mafuta mengi ikipakwa baada ya kupima, kamwe si kabla, huweka ncha za vidole laini na husaidia sehemu za kuchoma kupona. Chagua tyubu ndogo inayoingia kwenye mfuko wa vifaa vya kupima au mkoba na fomula yenye manukato kidogo. Kubadilisha vidole na kuchoma pembeni badala ya katikati pia hulinda ncha za vidole. Afya inauza krimu za mikono karibu na kaunta ya vipimo kama nyongeza ya faraja."],["Comfort add-on with impulse appeal at the testing counter","Nyongeza ya faraja yenye mvuto wa kununua papo hapo kwenye kaunta ya vipimo"]],"hd_foot_oral":[["Gum disease is more common and more severe in people with diabetes, and it makes blood-sugar control harder; studies also link periodontitis with higher blood pressure. Many heart and blood-pressure medicines cause a dry mouth, which raises the risk of decay and thrush. Alongside twice-daily fluoride toothpaste and a soft brush, an alcohol-free or fluoride mouthwash and a saliva-replacement gel for dry mouth help protect teeth and gums. See a dentist at least once a year and report bleeding gums or loose teeth promptly. Afya stocks these because a healthy mouth is part of managing a chronic condition.","Ugonjwa wa fizi hutokea zaidi na kwa ukali zaidi kwa wenye kisukari, na hufanya kudhibiti sukari kuwa vigumu zaidi; tafiti pia zinahusisha ugonjwa wa fizi (periodontitis) na shinikizo la juu la damu. Dawa nyingi za moyo na shinikizo husababisha kinywa kikavu, jambo linaloongeza hatari ya meno kuoza na fangasi wa kinywa. Pamoja na dawa ya meno yenye floraidi mara mbili kwa siku na mswaki laini, dawa ya kusukutua isiyo na pombe au yenye floraidi na jeli ya kubadilisha mate kwa kinywa kikavu husaidia kulinda meno na fizi. Mwone daktari wa meno angalau mara moja kwa mwaka na ripoti mapema fizi zinazotoa damu au meno yanayolegea. Afya inauza bidhaa hizi kwa sababu kinywa chenye afya ni sehemu ya kudhibiti ugonjwa sugu."],["Cross-category sale that deepens the chronic-care relationship","Mauzo ya kuvuka idara yanayoimarisha uhusiano wa huduma za magonjwa sugu"]],"hd_food_oats":[["Oats are a whole grain rich in beta-glucan, a soluble fibre that lowers LDL cholesterol and slows the rise in blood sugar after a meal. Choose plain rolled or jumbo oats rather than instant sweetened sachets, and cook them as uji with water or low-fat milk, sweetening with cinnamon or a little fruit instead of sugar. A 40 g portion (about half a cup dry) makes a filling breakfast, so a 500 g pack lasts one person around two weeks. Oats can also thicken soups or replace part of the flour in chapati and maandazi. Afya stocks oats as an affordable, familiar swap that customers can make tomorrow morning.","Shayiri (oats) ni nafaka isiyokobolewa yenye beta-glucan kwa wingi, nyuzinyuzi zinazoyeyuka zinazoshusha lehemu mbaya (LDL) na kupunguza kasi ya sukari kupanda baada ya kula. Chagua shayiri za kawaida zilizobanwa au kubwa (jumbo) badala ya pakiti za papo hapo zenye sukari, na uzipike kama uji kwa maji au maziwa yenye mafuta kidogo, ukiongeza ladha kwa mdalasini au tunda kidogo badala ya sukari. Kiasi cha gramu 40 (takriban nusu kikombe kikavu) hutoa kifungua kinywa cha kushibisha, hivyo pakiti ya gramu 500 humtosha mtu mmoja takriban wiki mbili. Shayiri pia zinaweza kuzidisha uzito wa supu au kuchukua nafasi ya sehemu ya unga kwenye chapati na maandazi. Afya inauza shayiri kama mabadiliko ya bei nafuu na yanayozoeleka ambayo mteja anaweza kuanza kesho asubuhi."],["Familiar, affordable food swap with weekly repeat and Afya Box fit","Mabadiliko ya chakula yanayozoeleka na nafuu yanayonunuliwa kila wiki na kufaa Afya Box"]],"hd_food_mil":[["Finger millet (ulezi) and sorghum (mtama) flours are traditional East African whole grains with more fibre, calcium and iron than refined maize flour, and they produce a gentler rise in blood sugar when eaten as unsweetened uji. Choose pure millet or sorghum flour or a blend without added sugar, and cook it thick enough to be filling. Sweeten lightly with a non-sugar sweetener or skip sweetening, and add groundnut paste or milk for protein. A 1 kg pack makes about 20–25 cups of uji. Afya stocks these because they fit the way Tanzanian families already eat.","Unga wa ulezi na mtama ni nafaka za asili za Afrika Mashariki zisizokobolewa zenye nyuzinyuzi, kalsiamu na madini ya chuma zaidi kuliko unga wa mahindi uliokobolewa, na husababisha sukari ya damu kupanda taratibu zaidi zikiliwa kama uji usio na sukari. Chagua unga safi wa ulezi au mtama au mchanganyiko usioongezwa sukari, na upike uji mzito wa kushibisha. Ongeza utamu kidogo kwa kitamu mbadala kisicho sukari au usiongeze kabisa, na weka siagi ya karanga au maziwa kwa protini. Pakiti ya kilo 1 hutoa takriban vikombe 20–25 vya uji. Afya inauza unga huu kwa sababu unaendana na jinsi familia za Kitanzania zinavyokula tayari."],["Culturally familiar staple with very low price and high weekly volume","Chakula kikuu kinachozoeleka kiutamaduni chenye bei ndogo sana na wingi wa mauzo kila wiki"]],"hd_food_cereal":[["Ready-to-eat cereals range from whole-grain and low in sugar to products that are mostly sugar, so the label matters. Choose cereals with whole grain listed first, at least 6 g fibre and under 5 g sugar per 100 g, and no added sugar where possible; whole-wheat biscuits and no-added-sugar muesli fit this. Serve with low-fat milk and add fruit for sweetness rather than spooning sugar on top. A portion is around 40 g (two whole-wheat biscuits), so a 450 g pack gives about 11 breakfasts. Afya stocks these as convenient options for busy mornings that still fit a heart- and diabetes-friendly diet.","Nafaka za kula papo hapo hutofautiana kati ya zile zisizokobolewa zenye sukari kidogo hadi bidhaa ambazo kwa kiasi kikubwa ni sukari, kwa hiyo lebo ni muhimu. Chagua nafaka ambazo nafaka nzima imeandikwa kwanza, zenye angalau gramu 6 za nyuzinyuzi na chini ya gramu 5 za sukari kwa kila gramu 100, na zisizoongezwa sukari pale inapowezekana; biskuti za ngano nzima na muesli isiyoongezwa sukari zinafaa. Pakua na maziwa yenye mafuta kidogo na ongeza tunda kwa utamu badala ya kunyunyiza sukari juu. Kiasi cha mlo mmoja ni takriban gramu 40 (biskuti mbili za ngano nzima), hivyo pakiti ya gramu 450 hutoa takriban vifungua kinywa 11. Afya inauza hizi kama chaguo rahisi kwa asubuhi zenye shughuli nyingi ambazo bado zinaendana na lishe rafiki kwa moyo na kisukari."],["Convenience swap with steady repeat among urban families","Mabadiliko rahisi yanayonunuliwa mara kwa mara na familia za mjini"]],"hd_food_rice":[["Brown rice keeps its bran and germ, giving more fibre, magnesium and B vitamins than white rice, and large studies associate replacing white with brown rice with a lower risk of type 2 diabetes. It still contains starch, so portion matters: about one cupped hand of cooked rice per meal, with half the plate filled with vegetables and a quarter with beans, fish or chicken. Brown rice needs more water and around 35–45 minutes to cook; soaking it for an hour first shortens the time. Mixing half brown and half white is a practical first step for families used to pilau and wali. Afya stocks brown rice so customers can make the swap without visiting a specialty shop.","Mchele wa kahawia huhifadhi ganda lake la ndani na kiini, hivyo una nyuzinyuzi, magnesiamu na vitamini B zaidi kuliko mchele mweupe, na tafiti kubwa zinahusisha kubadili mchele mweupe kwa wa kahawia na hatari ndogo ya kisukari aina ya 2. Bado una wanga, kwa hiyo kiasi ni muhimu: takriban kiganja kimoja cha wali uliopikwa kwa mlo, nusu ya sahani ikijazwa mboga na robo maharagwe, samaki au kuku. Mchele wa kahawia unahitaji maji zaidi na takriban dakika 35–45 kuiva; kuuloweka kwa saa moja kwanza hupunguza muda. Kuchanganya nusu kahawia na nusu mweupe ni hatua ya kwanza ya vitendo kwa familia zilizozoea pilau na wali. Afya inauza mchele wa kahawia ili wateja wabadili bila kwenda duka maalum."],["Staple-food upgrade with large pack sizes and regular repeat","Kuboresha chakula kikuu kwa pakiti kubwa na ununuzi wa mara kwa mara"]],"hd_food_flour":[["Brown or wholemeal flour keeps more of the wheat bran, so foods made from it are more filling and raise blood sugar less sharply than those made with white flour. For chapati, start by replacing a third to a half of white flour with brown flour, then increase as the family gets used to the taste and texture; add a little more water because bran absorbs it. Cook chapati with a light brush of oil rather than frying in a pool of it, which also helps the heart. Store brown flour in a sealed container and use within a few months, as the bran oils can turn rancid in the heat. Afya stocks it to help families keep their favourite foods while improving them.","Unga wa ngano ya kahawia au usiokobolewa huhifadhi sehemu kubwa ya ganda la ngano, hivyo vyakula vinavyotengenezwa nao hushibisha zaidi na hupandisha sukari ya damu taratibu zaidi kuliko vile vya unga mweupe. Kwa chapati, anza kwa kubadilisha theluthi moja hadi nusu ya unga mweupe kwa unga wa kahawia, kisha ongeza kadiri familia inavyozoea ladha na umbile; ongeza maji kidogo zaidi kwa sababu ganda hufyonza maji. Pika chapati kwa kupaka mafuta kidogo kwa brashi badala ya kukaanga kwenye mafuta mengi, jambo linalosaidia pia moyo. Hifadhi unga wa kahawia kwenye chombo kilichofungwa na utumie ndani ya miezi michache, kwa kuwa mafuta ya ganda yanaweza kuharibika kwenye joto. Afya inauza unga huu kusaidia familia kuendelea na vyakula vyao wanavyovipenda huku wakiviboresha."],["Low-price staple swap that fits everyday cooking","Mabadiliko ya chakula kikuu ya bei ndogo yanayoendana na mapishi ya kila siku"]],"hd_food_beans":[["Beans are one of the best foods for blood sugar and heart health: rich in fibre, plant protein, potassium and magnesium, low in fat and slow to digest. Replacing some red meat with beans lowers saturated fat intake, and eating pulses regularly is linked to lower cholesterol and blood pressure. Soak dry beans overnight, discard the water, and boil until fully soft; cook with onions, tomatoes, garlic and spices rather than lots of salt or coconut cream. A family of four uses about 1–2 kg a week. Afya stocks familiar Tanzanian and Kenyan varieties at everyday prices.","Maharagwe ni moja ya vyakula bora zaidi kwa sukari ya damu na afya ya moyo: yana nyuzinyuzi, protini ya mimea, potasiamu na magnesiamu kwa wingi, mafuta kidogo na humeng'enywa taratibu. Kubadilisha sehemu ya nyama nyekundu kwa maharagwe hupunguza ulaji wa mafuta yaliyoganda, na kula jamii ya kunde mara kwa mara kunahusishwa na lehemu na shinikizo la chini. Loweka maharagwe makavu usiku kucha, mwaga maji hayo, na chemsha hadi yalainike kabisa; pika kwa vitunguu, nyanya, kitunguu saumu na viungo badala ya chumvi nyingi au tui zito la nazi. Familia ya watu wanne hutumia takriban kilo 1–2 kwa wiki. Afya inauza aina zinazojulikana za Tanzania na Kenya kwa bei ya kila siku."],["High-volume staple with health credibility and very low price","Chakula kikuu cha wingi chenye uaminifu wa kiafya na bei ndogo sana"]],"hd_food_lentil":[["Lentils and split pulses such as masoor and mung dal give the same fibre and protein benefits as beans but cook in 20–30 minutes without soaking, which saves fuel and time. Green and brown lentils hold their shape for stews and salads; red lentils and split mung soften into dal and soups that suit older adults. Pair with brown rice or chapati to make a complete protein, and season with garlic, ginger, cumin and lemon instead of extra salt. People with advanced kidney disease may be advised to limit potassium and phosphorus, so they should follow their renal dietitian on portion size. Afya stocks a small range because lentils are an easy, affordable step toward plant-based meals.","Dengu na kunde zilizopasuliwa kama masoor na mung dal hutoa faida zilezile za nyuzinyuzi na protini kama maharagwe lakini huiva kwa dakika 20–30 bila kulowekwa, jambo linalookoa mkaa, gesi na muda. Dengu za kijani na kahawia hubaki na umbo lake kwa mchuzi na saladi; dengu nyekundu na mung zilizopasuliwa hulainika kuwa dal na supu zinazowafaa wazee. Kula pamoja na mchele wa kahawia au chapati kupata protini kamili, na tia ladha kwa kitunguu saumu, tangawizi, bizari na limau badala ya chumvi zaidi. Watu wenye ugonjwa wa figo uliokomaa wanaweza kushauriwa kupunguza potasiamu na fosforasi, kwa hiyo wafuate mtaalamu wao wa lishe ya figo kuhusu kiasi. Afya inauza aina chache kwa sababu dengu ni hatua rahisi na nafuu kuelekea milo ya mimea."],["Quick-cook, affordable protein that builds a healthy-pantry habit","Protini nafuu inayoiva haraka inayojenga tabia ya stoo yenye afya"]],"hd_food_sweet":[["Sugar in tea is one of the largest sources of added sugar in Tanzanian diets: three cups a day with two spoons each adds about 30 g of sugar. Low-calorie sweetener tablets give sweetness without raising blood sugar, and are approved as safe within acceptable daily intakes by food-safety authorities; one tablet usually equals one teaspoon of sugar. WHO advises against relying on non-sugar sweeteners for long-term weight control, so the best use is as a bridge while gradually getting used to less sweetness. People with phenylketonuria must avoid aspartame. Afya stocks dispensers in several sizes because this is one of the most frequent requests from newly diagnosed customers.","Sukari kwenye chai ni mojawapo ya vyanzo vikubwa vya sukari iliyoongezwa katika lishe ya Watanzania: vikombe vitatu kwa siku vyenye vijiko viwili kila kimoja huongeza takriban gramu 30 za sukari. Vidonge vya vitamu mbadala vyenye kalori kidogo hutoa utamu bila kupandisha sukari ya damu, na vimeidhinishwa kuwa salama ndani ya kiwango cha kila siku kinachokubalika na mamlaka za usalama wa chakula; kidonge kimoja kwa kawaida ni sawa na kijiko kimoja cha chai cha sukari. WHO inashauri kutotegemea vitamu mbadala visivyo sukari kwa kudhibiti uzito kwa muda mrefu, kwa hiyo matumizi bora ni kama daraja huku ukizoea taratibu utamu mdogo. Watu wenye ugonjwa wa phenylketonuria lazima waepuke aspartame. Afya inauza vifaa vya kutolea vya saizi mbalimbali kwa sababu hili ni ombi la mara kwa mara kutoka kwa wateja waliogundulika karibuni."],["Daily-use item with high repeat and strong first-visit demand","Bidhaa ya kila siku inayonunuliwa tena mara nyingi na kuhitajika sana ziara ya kwanza"]],"hd_food_stevia":[["Stevia (from the stevia leaf, now also grown in Kenya) and monk fruit (luo han guo) are intensely sweet, contain almost no calories and do not raise blood sugar. Granulated blends, often with erythritol, measure like sugar and work in uji and home baking, while tablets suit tea. Some people notice a slight aftertaste; trying a small pack first helps. As with all non-sugar sweeteners, WHO guidance is to use them to reduce sugar rather than as a weight-loss tool, and large amounts of erythritol can cause bloating. Afya stocks plant-based options for customers who ask for a natural alternative.","Stevia (kutoka kwenye jani la stevia, ambalo sasa hulimwa pia Kenya) na monk fruit (luo han guo) ni vitamu vikali sana, karibu havina kalori na havipandishi sukari ya damu. Michanganyiko ya chembechembe, mara nyingi pamoja na erythritol, hupimwa kama sukari na hufaa kwenye uji na kuoka nyumbani, huku vidonge vikifaa kwa chai. Baadhi ya watu huhisi ladha kidogo inayobaki mdomoni; kujaribu pakiti ndogo kwanza husaidia. Kama vitamu vyote mbadala visivyo sukari, mwongozo wa WHO ni kuvitumia kupunguza sukari badala ya kama njia ya kupunguza uzito, na kiasi kikubwa cha erythritol kinaweza kusababisha tumbo kujaa gesi. Afya inauza chaguo hizi za mimea kwa wateja wanaoomba mbadala wa asili."],["Premium natural positioning with higher margin than standard sweeteners","Nafasi ya bidhaa asilia ya hadhi yenye faida kubwa kuliko vitamu vya kawaida"]],"hd_food_spice":[["WHO recommends adults eat less than 5 g of salt a day (about one level teaspoon), yet most people eat about double, and reducing salt lowers blood pressure within weeks. Pure ground garlic, ginger, black pepper and other single spices add strong flavour without sodium, unlike stock cubes, seasoning salts and mchuzi mixes, which are often high in salt. Check that the label lists only the spice, with no added salt. Introduce them gradually as you cut back on salt, since taste adjusts to lower salt in about two to three weeks. Afya stocks pure spices as a practical tool for one of the most effective changes in blood-pressure care.","WHO inapendekeza watu wazima wale chini ya gramu 5 za chumvi kwa siku (takriban kijiko kimoja cha chai kilichosawazishwa), lakini watu wengi hula karibu mara mbili ya hapo, na kupunguza chumvi hushusha shinikizo la damu ndani ya wiki chache. Kitunguu saumu, tangawizi, pilipili manga na viungo vingine safi vilivyosagwa huongeza ladha kali bila sodiamu, tofauti na vidonge vya supu, chumvi za viungo na michanganyiko ya mchuzi ambavyo mara nyingi vina chumvi nyingi. Hakikisha lebo inaorodhesha kiungo tu, bila chumvi iliyoongezwa. Viingize taratibu kadiri unavyopunguza chumvi, kwa kuwa ulimi huzoea chumvi kidogo ndani ya wiki mbili hadi tatu. Afya inauza viungo safi kama chombo cha vitendo kwa mojawapo ya mabadiliko yenye matokeo makubwa katika kudhibiti shinikizo la damu."],["Low-price kitchen add-on that turns salt advice into a purchase","Nyongeza ya jikoni ya bei ndogo inayogeuza ushauri wa chumvi kuwa ununuzi"]],"hd_food_nuts":[["Nuts provide healthy unsaturated fats, protein, fibre and magnesium, and eating a small handful most days is associated with lower risk of heart disease. Choose unsalted and unsweetened nuts: salted, sugar-coated or fried versions undo much of the benefit. Cashews, which Tanzania grows, and groundnuts are affordable local choices; a portion is about 30 g, roughly a small handful, because nuts are energy-dense. They make a good replacement for biscuits or mandazi as a snack and help prevent blood-sugar dips between meals. Afya stocks unsalted packs in sizes suited to portioning.","Karanga na korosho hutoa mafuta mazuri yasiyoganda, protini, nyuzinyuzi na magnesiamu, na kula kiganja kidogo siku nyingi kunahusishwa na hatari ndogo ya magonjwa ya moyo. Chagua zisizo na chumvi wala sukari: zilizotiwa chumvi, kupakwa sukari au kukaangwa hupoteza sehemu kubwa ya faida. Korosho, zinazolimwa Tanzania, na karanga ni chaguo nafuu za nyumbani; kiasi cha mlo ni takriban gramu 30, yaani kiganja kidogo, kwa sababu zina nguvu nyingi. Ni mbadala mzuri wa biskuti au maandazi kama kitafunwa na husaidia kuzuia sukari kushuka kati ya milo. Afya inauza pakiti zisizo na chumvi za saizi zinazofaa kugawa kiasi."],["Local-pride healthy snack with good margin and gifting potential","Kitafunwa cha afya cha fahari ya nyumbani chenye faida nzuri na fursa ya zawadi"]],"hd_food_seeds":[["Chia and ground flaxseed are rich in soluble fibre and alpha-linolenic acid, a plant omega-3 fat; adding them to meals slows sugar absorption and modestly lowers cholesterol. Flaxseed should be ground just before use or bought ground, because whole seeds pass through undigested; chia can be eaten whole once soaked. Start with one teaspoon a day and build to one or two tablespoons, drinking plenty of water, since a sudden jump in fibre can cause bloating. People on blood thinners should ask their clinician before taking large daily amounts. Afya stocks small packs so customers can try them affordably.","Chia na mbegu za kitani zilizosagwa zina nyuzinyuzi zinazoyeyuka na asidi ya alpha-linolenic, mafuta ya omega-3 ya mimea, kwa wingi; kuziongeza kwenye milo hupunguza kasi ya kufyonzwa kwa sukari na hushusha lehemu kidogo. Mbegu za kitani zisagwe muda mfupi kabla ya kutumia au zinunuliwe zikiwa zimesagwa, kwa sababu nzima hupita bila kumeng'enywa; chia inaweza kuliwa nzima baada ya kulowekwa. Anza na kijiko kimoja cha chai kwa siku na uongeze hadi kijiko kikubwa kimoja au viwili, ukinywa maji mengi, kwa kuwa kuongeza nyuzinyuzi ghafla kunaweza kusababisha tumbo kujaa gesi. Watu wanaotumia dawa za kuyeyusha damu wamuulize mtaalamu wa afya kabla ya kutumia kiasi kikubwa kila siku. Afya inauza pakiti ndogo ili wateja wajaribu kwa bei nafuu."],["Trend-driven premium pantry item with easy add-on sales","Bidhaa ya stoo ya hadhi inayofuata mwenendo, rahisi kuuzwa kama nyongeza"]],"hd_food_tea":[["Swapping two or three cups of sweet chai or a daily soda for unsweetened tea removes a large amount of added sugar without giving up a familiar ritual. Green tea, caffeine-free rooibos and herbal infusions such as hibiscus or ginger are enjoyable without sugar; a squeeze of lemon or a slice of ginger adds flavour. Hibiscus tea has shown modest blood-pressure lowering in small trials, though it is not a substitute for medicine. People with heart rhythm problems may prefer caffeine-free options in the evening. Afya stocks a small curated range to make sugar-free drinking easy.","Kubadilisha vikombe viwili au vitatu vya chai tamu ya maziwa au soda ya kila siku kwa chai isiyo na sukari huondoa kiasi kikubwa cha sukari iliyoongezwa bila kuacha desturi inayozoeleka. Chai ya kijani, rooibos isiyo na kafeini na chai za mitishamba kama rosella (hibiscus) au tangawizi zinafurahisha bila sukari; kukamulia limau au kipande cha tangawizi huongeza ladha. Chai ya rosella imeonyesha kushusha shinikizo kidogo katika majaribio madogo, ingawa si mbadala wa dawa. Watu wenye matatizo ya mapigo ya moyo wanaweza kupendelea chaguo zisizo na kafeini jioni. Afya inauza mkusanyiko mdogo uliochaguliwa ili kunywa bila sukari kuwe rahisi."],["Daily-habit replacement with steady repeat and gift-box use","Mbadala wa tabia ya kila siku unaonunuliwa mara kwa mara na kufaa kwenye zawadi"]],"hd_food_gum":[["Sugar-free gum sweetened with xylitol or sorbitol stimulates saliva, which protects teeth and relieves the dry mouth caused by many blood-pressure and heart medicines. For dialysis patients on a fluid limit, trials show chewing sugar-free gum reduces thirst and dry mouth, helping them stay within their daily fluid allowance. Gum can also help some people resist sweets after meals. Choose gum labelled sugar-free and limit to a few pieces a day, as large amounts of sugar alcohols can loosen the stomach. Afya stocks bottles and packs near the checkout and in the kidney-care bay.","Bazoka isiyo na sukari iliyotiwa utamu kwa xylitol au sorbitol huchochea mate, ambayo hulinda meno na kupunguza kinywa kikavu kinachosababishwa na dawa nyingi za shinikizo na moyo. Kwa wagonjwa wa kusafishwa damu (dialysis) waliowekewa kikomo cha maji, majaribio yanaonyesha kutafuna bazoka isiyo na sukari hupunguza kiu na kinywa kikavu, na kuwasaidia kubaki ndani ya kiasi chao cha maji cha kila siku. Bazoka pia inaweza kuwasaidia baadhi ya watu kujizuia na vitamu baada ya kula. Chagua bazoka iliyoandikwa haina sukari na ujizuie kwa vipande vichache kwa siku, kwa kuwa kiasi kikubwa cha sukari-alkoholi kinaweza kulegeza tumbo. Afya inauza chupa na pakiti karibu na mahali pa kulipia na kwenye sehemu ya utunzaji wa figo."],["Impulse checkout item with a genuine clinical story for kidney patients","Bidhaa ya kununua papo hapo kaunta yenye simulizi halisi ya kitabibu kwa wagonjwa wa figo"]],"hd_food_oil":[["Replacing saturated fats such as palm oil, ghee, lard and coconut fat with unsaturated vegetable oils lowers LDL cholesterol and the risk of heart disease. Sunflower oil, widely produced in Tanzania, is rich in unsaturated fat and suitable for everyday cooking. Quantity still matters: oil is very energy-dense, so measure with a spoon rather than pouring, and favour boiling, steaming, grilling and stewing over deep-frying. A household of four using about one tablespoon per person per day needs roughly 1.5–2 litres a month. Afya stocks sunflower oil so the healthier choice sits beside the rest of the heart-smart pantry.","Kubadilisha mafuta yaliyoganda kama mawese, samli, mafuta ya nguruwe na mafuta ya nazi kwa mafuta ya mimea yasiyoganda hushusha lehemu mbaya (LDL) na hatari ya magonjwa ya moyo. Mafuta ya alizeti, yanayozalishwa kwa wingi Tanzania, yana mafuta yasiyoganda kwa wingi na yanafaa kwa mapishi ya kila siku. Kiasi bado ni muhimu: mafuta yana nguvu nyingi sana, kwa hiyo pima kwa kijiko badala ya kumimina, na pendelea kuchemsha, kupika kwa mvuke, kuchoma na kutokosa kuliko kukaanga kwenye mafuta mengi. Familia ya watu wanne inayotumia takriban kijiko kikubwa kimoja kwa mtu kwa siku huhitaji lita 1.5–2 kwa mwezi. Afya inauza mafuta ya alizeti ili chaguo bora likae kando ya bidhaa nyingine za stoo rafiki kwa moyo."],["Essential grocery that brings weekly footfall into the health store","Bidhaa muhimu ya chakula inayoleta wateja dukani kila wiki"]],"hd_food_olive":[["Extra-virgin olive oil is rich in monounsaturated fat and protective plant compounds, and in large trials a Mediterranean-style diet with olive oil reduced heart attacks and strokes. It is best used raw on salads and vegetables or for gentle sautéing; for deep-frying, a cheaper vegetable oil is more practical. Buy dark bottles, keep them away from the stove and sunlight, and use within a few months of opening. It is calorie-dense like all oils, so a tablespoon is a portion. Afya stocks a few sizes for customers who want a premium heart-healthy oil.","Mafuta ya zeituni halisi (extra-virgin) yana mafuta yasiyoganda ya aina ya monounsaturated na viambato vya mimea vinavyolinda kwa wingi, na katika majaribio makubwa lishe ya mtindo wa Mediterania yenye mafuta ya zeituni ilipunguza mshtuko wa moyo na kiharusi. Yanafaa zaidi yakitumika bila kupikwa kwenye saladi na mboga au kwa kukaanga kidogo kwa moto mdogo; kwa kukaanga kwenye mafuta mengi, mafuta ya mimea ya bei nafuu yanafaa zaidi. Nunua chupa zenye rangi nzito, ziweke mbali na jiko na jua, na tumia ndani ya miezi michache baada ya kufungua. Yana kalori nyingi kama mafuta yote, kwa hiyo kijiko kikubwa kimoja ni kiasi cha mlo. Afya inauza saizi chache kwa wateja wanaotaka mafuta ya hadhi yenye afya kwa moyo."],["Premium pantry item with strong margin and festive gifting","Bidhaa ya stoo ya hadhi yenye faida nzuri na inayofaa zawadi za sikukuu"]],"hd_food_fish":[["Fish is a lean protein, and eating fish twice a week is recommended for heart health; canned tuna is a convenient, shelf-stable option when fresh fish is not to hand. Choose tuna in spring water or brine rather than oil to keep fat and calories down, and drain and rinse brine-packed fish to remove some of the salt. Combine with beans, tomatoes, onion and lemon for a filling salad, or mix into brown rice. Pregnant women and young children should keep tuna to one or two cans a week because of mercury; fresh dagaa and sardines are excellent local alternatives. Afya stocks tuna as a pantry protein for busy households.","Samaki ni protini isiyo na mafuta mengi, na kula samaki mara mbili kwa wiki kunapendekezwa kwa afya ya moyo; jodari wa kopo ni chaguo rahisi linalodumu stooni pale samaki wabichi hawapatikani. Chagua jodari kwenye maji safi au maji ya chumvi kidogo badala ya mafuta ili kupunguza mafuta na kalori, na chuja na suuza samaki wa maji ya chumvi kuondoa sehemu ya chumvi. Changanya na maharagwe, nyanya, kitunguu na limau kwa saladi ya kushibisha, au changanya na mchele wa kahawia. Wanawake wajawazito na watoto wadogo wajizuie kwa kopo moja au mawili kwa wiki kwa sababu ya zebaki; dagaa wabichi na sardini ni mbadala bora wa nyumbani. Afya inauza jodari kama protini ya stoo kwa familia zenye shughuli nyingi."],["Convenient protein that broadens the heart-smart pantry beyond grains","Protini rahisi inayopanua stoo rafiki kwa moyo zaidi ya nafaka"]],"hd_food_milk":[["Low-fat and fat-free milks keep the protein, calcium and potassium of whole milk while cutting saturated fat, which is why heart-health guidelines recommend them for adults. Long-life UHT cartons and skimmed milk powder store well without a fridge, which suits homes with frequent power cuts. Use them in tea, uji and oats; the taste difference fades within a couple of weeks. They are not suitable as the main milk for children under two, who need full-fat milk. Afya stocks shelf-stable low-fat options so the switch is easy year-round.","Maziwa yenye mafuta kidogo na yasiyo na mafuta huhifadhi protini, kalsiamu na potasiamu ya maziwa kamili huku yakipunguza mafuta yaliyoganda, ndiyo sababu miongozo ya afya ya moyo inayapendekeza kwa watu wazima. Maziwa ya UHT ya muda mrefu kwenye boksi na unga wa maziwa usio na mafuta huhifadhika vizuri bila jokofu, jambo linalofaa nyumba zenye kukatika umeme mara kwa mara. Yatumie kwenye chai, uji na shayiri; tofauti ya ladha hupotea ndani ya wiki moja au mbili. Hayafai kuwa maziwa makuu kwa watoto chini ya miaka miwili, wanaohitaji maziwa kamili. Afya inauza chaguo zinazodumu bila jokofu zenye mafuta kidogo ili kubadili kuwe rahisi mwaka mzima."],["Everyday grocery switch with frequent repeat purchases","Mabadiliko ya chakula cha kila siku yanayonunuliwa mara kwa mara"]],"hd_food_jam":[["Ordinary jam is about two-thirds sugar, so a thick spread on bread can add 10 g of sugar in a single slice. Sugar-free jams are sweetened with low-calorie sweeteners and thickened with pectin, giving fruit flavour with far less impact on blood sugar. They still contain some natural fruit sugar, so use a thin layer and pair with whole-grain bread. Once opened, keep the jar in the fridge and use within a few weeks, since without sugar as a preservative it spoils faster. Afya stocks sugar-free jam as a small comfort that makes a diabetes diet easier to keep.","Jamu ya kawaida ni takriban theluthi mbili sukari, kwa hiyo kupaka kwa wingi kwenye mkate kunaweza kuongeza gramu 10 za sukari kwa kipande kimoja. Jamu zisizo na sukari hutiwa utamu kwa vitamu mbadala vyenye kalori kidogo na huzidishwa uzito kwa pectin, zikitoa ladha ya matunda bila kuathiri sana sukari ya damu. Bado zina sukari kidogo ya asili ya matunda, kwa hiyo paka tabaka jembamba na kula na mkate wa nafaka nzima. Ukishafungua, weka chupa kwenye jokofu na tumia ndani ya wiki chache, kwa kuwa bila sukari kama kihifadhi huharibika haraka zaidi. Afya inauza jamu isiyo na sukari kama faraja ndogo inayorahisisha kufuata lishe ya kisukari."],["Small treat that rewards loyalty and lifts grocery basket value","Kiburudisho kidogo kinachotuza uaminifu na kuongeza thamani ya kikapu cha chakula"]],"hd_food_snack":[["Biscuits, mandazi and cakes with tea are a common daily habit that adds a lot of sugar and refined flour. No-added-sugar oat cookies and nut or seed bars offer a planned alternative, but they still contain starch and some natural sugars, so check the carbohydrate per piece and keep to one or two. They are useful to carry for people on insulin or sulphonylureas who need a starchy snack after treating a hypo or when a meal is delayed. Whole fruit and a few unsalted nuts remain the best everyday snack. Afya stocks a small range so customers have a better choice at tea time.","Biskuti, maandazi na keki pamoja na chai ni tabia ya kawaida ya kila siku inayoongeza sukari nyingi na unga uliokobolewa. Biskuti za shayiri zisizoongezwa sukari na baa za karanga au mbegu ni mbadala uliopangwa, lakini bado zina wanga na sukari kidogo ya asili, kwa hiyo angalia kiasi cha wanga kwa kipande na jizuie kwa kimoja au viwili. Zinafaa kubebwa na wanaotumia insulini au vidonge vya sulphonylurea wanaohitaji kitafunwa chenye wanga baada ya kutibu sukari iliyoshuka au mlo unapochelewa. Matunda mazima na karanga chache zisizo na chumvi bado ni vitafunwa bora vya kila siku. Afya inauza aina chache ili wateja wawe na chaguo bora wakati wa chai."],["Impulse-friendly snack with repeat purchase and hypo-kit fit","Kitafunwa cha kununua papo hapo kinachorudiwa na kufaa kwenye kifurushi cha sukari kushuka"]],"hd_food_spoon":[["Advice like less than 5 g of salt a day or one tablespoon of oil per person is only useful if the cook can measure it. A standard measuring-spoon set (1/4 tsp to 1 tbsp) makes it simple: a level teaspoon of salt is about 5 g, the whole day's limit for one adult. Measure salt into the pot at the start of cooking and leave the salt shaker off the table. The same spoons help measure glucose powder for a hypo and ORS. Afya stocks inexpensive steel sets because they turn dietary advice into a daily habit.","Ushauri kama chini ya gramu 5 za chumvi kwa siku au kijiko kikubwa kimoja cha mafuta kwa mtu una maana tu kama mpishi anaweza kupima. Seti ya kawaida ya vijiko vya kupimia (robo kijiko cha chai hadi kijiko kikubwa) hurahisisha: kijiko kimoja cha chai cha chumvi kilichosawazishwa ni takriban gramu 5, ambacho ndicho kikomo cha siku nzima kwa mtu mzima mmoja. Pima chumvi kuweka kwenye sufuria mwanzoni mwa kupika na usiweke kichupa cha chumvi mezani. Vijiko hivyohivyo husaidia kupima unga wa glukosi kwa sukari iliyoshuka na ORS. Afya inauza seti za chuma za bei nafuu kwa sababu hugeuza ushauri wa lishe kuwa tabia ya kila siku."],["Cheap tool that anchors counselling and sells with every food basket","Kifaa cha bei nafuu kinachoshikilia ushauri na kuuzwa na kila kikapu cha chakula"]],"hd_food_kscale":[["People with diabetes, especially those on insulin, benefit from learning what a portion of rice, ugali, bread or oats actually looks like, and a kitchen scale makes this concrete. Weigh the usual serving once or twice, then use the same bowl or cup as a guide; most people discover they eat larger starch portions than they think. A digital scale with a tare button, 1 g resolution and a 5 kg capacity is enough for home use. It is also useful for dietitian-guided kidney and weight-loss plans. Afya stocks simple scales because portion skills last long after the scale goes back in the cupboard.","Wenye kisukari, hasa wanaotumia insulini, hunufaika kwa kujifunza kiasi halisi cha mlo wa wali, ugali, mkate au shayiri kinavyoonekana, na mizani ya jikoni hufanya hili liwe wazi. Pima kiasi chako cha kawaida mara moja au mbili, kisha tumia bakuli au kikombe kilekile kama kipimo; watu wengi hugundua wanakula wanga zaidi kuliko wanavyodhani. Mizani ya kidijitali yenye kitufe cha kuondoa uzito wa chombo (tare), usahihi wa gramu 1 na uwezo wa kilo 5 inatosha kwa matumizi ya nyumbani. Pia inafaa kwa mipango ya figo na kupunguza uzito inayoongozwa na mtaalamu wa lishe. Afya inauza mizani rahisi kwa sababu ujuzi wa kiasi hudumu muda mrefu hata baada ya mizani kurudishwa kabatini."],["Mid-ticket gadget that supports dietitian services and gifting","Kifaa cha bei ya kati kinachosaidia huduma za lishe na zawadi"]],"hd_vit_scale":[["Losing 5–10% of body weight in people who are overweight improves blood sugar, blood pressure and cholesterol, and a home scale makes progress visible. For people with heart failure, a rise of more than 2 kg in three days can signal fluid build-up and is a reason to call the clinic, so daily weighing is part of their care plan. Choose a stable digital scale with a large display, a capacity of at least 150 kg and 100 g steps, and place it on a hard, level floor. Weigh at the same time each morning after using the toilet and before eating, in similar clothes. Afya stocks reliable scales at entry and mid prices.","Kupunguza asilimia 5–10 ya uzito wa mwili kwa watu wenye uzito mkubwa huboresha sukari ya damu, shinikizo na lehemu, na mizani ya nyumbani hufanya maendeleo yaonekane. Kwa wenye moyo kushindwa kufanya kazi, kuongezeka kwa zaidi ya kilo 2 ndani ya siku tatu kunaweza kuashiria maji kujaa mwilini na ni sababu ya kupiga simu kliniki, kwa hiyo kujipima kila siku ni sehemu ya mpango wao wa matibabu. Chagua mizani ya kidijitali iliyo imara yenye skrini kubwa, uwezo wa angalau kilo 150 na hatua za gramu 100, na iweke kwenye sakafu ngumu iliyo sawa. Jipime saa ileile kila asubuhi baada ya kwenda chooni na kabla ya kula, ukiwa na nguo zinazofanana. Afya inauza mizani za kuaminika kwa bei ya kuanzia na ya kati."],["Durable household device with broad appeal beyond chronic-care customers","Kifaa cha kudumu cha nyumbani kinachovutia hata wasio na magonjwa sugu"]],"hd_vit_smart":[["Smart scales estimate body fat, muscle and water by passing a tiny current through the feet and sync results to a phone, showing trends over weeks. The body-fat figures are estimates that change with hydration and time of day, so they are best used to track direction rather than as an exact number. Weigh under the same conditions each day, barefoot on a hard floor. People with a pacemaker or implanted defibrillator should not use the body-composition function, and it is not advised in pregnancy. Afya stocks a smart scale for customers who are motivated by data and app tracking.","Mizani janja hukadiria mafuta ya mwili, misuli na maji kwa kupitisha mkondo mdogo sana wa umeme miguuni na kusawazisha matokeo na simu, ikionyesha mwenendo wa wiki kadhaa. Takwimu za mafuta ya mwili ni makadirio yanayobadilika kulingana na kiasi cha maji mwilini na wakati wa siku, kwa hiyo zinafaa zaidi kufuatilia mwelekeo kuliko kama namba kamili. Jipime katika hali zilezile kila siku, bila viatu kwenye sakafu ngumu. Watu wenye kifaa cha kudhibiti mapigo ya moyo (pacemaker) au defibrillator iliyowekwa ndani wasitumie kipengele cha kupima muundo wa mwili, na haishauriwi wakati wa ujauzito. Afya inauza mizani janja kwa wateja wanaohamasishwa na takwimu na programu za simu."],["Higher-ticket tech item appealing to younger, app-using customers","Kifaa cha teknolojia cha bei ya juu kinachovutia wateja vijana wanaotumia programu"]],"hd_vit_ox":[["A pulse oximeter clips onto a finger and shows blood oxygen saturation (SpO2) and pulse rate in seconds. Most healthy adults read 95–100%; a persistent reading below 92%, or a drop together with breathlessness, needs prompt medical review. Accuracy falls with cold hands, poor circulation, movement, nail polish and, according to the US FDA, can be lower in people with darker skin, so trends and symptoms matter more than a single number. Rest for a few minutes, warm the hand, keep still and read after the number stabilises. Afya stocks oximeters as a useful home check for heart and lung patients, not as a replacement for a clinician.","Oksimita ya kidole hubanwa kwenye kidole na huonyesha kiwango cha oksijeni kwenye damu (SpO2) na mapigo ya moyo ndani ya sekunde chache. Watu wazima wengi wenye afya husoma asilimia 95–100; kipimo kinachobaki chini ya asilimia 92, au kushuka pamoja na kukosa pumzi, kunahitaji uchunguzi wa daktari haraka. Usahihi hupungua kwa mikono ya baridi, mzunguko hafifu wa damu, kutikisika, rangi ya kucha na, kwa mujibu wa FDA ya Marekani, unaweza kuwa mdogo zaidi kwa watu wenye ngozi nyeusi, kwa hiyo mwenendo na dalili ni muhimu kuliko namba moja. Pumzika dakika chache, pasha mkono joto, tulia na usome baada ya namba kutulia. Afya inauza oksimita kama kipimo cha nyumbani chenye manufaa kwa wagonjwa wa moyo na mapafu, si mbadala wa mtaalamu wa afya."],["Compact, mid-price device with strong demand from carers and the post-COVID habit","Kifaa kidogo cha bei ya kati kinachohitajika sana na walezi na tabia iliyozoeleka tangu COVID"]],"hd_vit_therm":[["Fever and infection push blood sugar up and can quickly destabilise heart and kidney conditions, so knowing when temperature is raised is part of a sick-day plan. A digital stick thermometer used under the tongue or armpit is accurate, cheap and safe, unlike old mercury models. A temperature of 38 °C or above in someone with diabetes, a foot wound, or on dialysis is a reason to contact a clinician the same day. Clean the tip with an alcohol pad after each use and replace the button battery when the display dims. Afya includes a thermometer in its chronic-care sick-day kit.","Homa na maambukizi hupandisha sukari ya damu na yanaweza kuvuruga haraka hali za moyo na figo, kwa hiyo kujua joto limepanda ni sehemu ya mpango wa siku za ugonjwa. Kipimajoto cha kidijitali cha kijiti kinachotumika chini ya ulimi au kwapani ni sahihi, cha bei nafuu na salama, tofauti na vya zamani vya zebaki. Joto la nyuzi 38 au zaidi kwa mwenye kisukari, mwenye jeraha mguuni au anayesafishwa damu ni sababu ya kuwasiliana na mtaalamu wa afya siku hiyohiyo. Safisha ncha kwa kitambaa cha pombe baada ya kila matumizi na badilisha betri ndogo ya kitufe skrini inapofifia. Afya inaweka kipimajoto katika kifurushi chake cha siku za ugonjwa kwa wagonjwa wa magonjwa sugu."],["Low-cost essential that completes the chronic-care sick-day kit","Hitaji la bei ndogo linalokamilisha kifurushi cha siku za ugonjwa"]],"hd_med_week":[["Missing doses is one of the main reasons blood pressure and blood sugar stay uncontrolled, and many people with heart disease and diabetes take four or more tablets a day. A seven-day organiser filled once a week shows at a glance whether today's dose has been taken. Choose large compartments if tablets are big or numerous, clear lids for older users, and a model with a secure snap so it does not spill in a handbag. Fill it from the original packs with the prescription in front of you, and keep the original packs for checking names, strengths and expiry. Afya stocks several sizes because a simple box is one of the most effective adherence tools available.","Kuruka dozi ni mojawapo ya sababu kuu za shinikizo na sukari kubaki bila kudhibitiwa, na watu wengi wenye magonjwa ya moyo na kisukari hutumia vidonge vinne au zaidi kwa siku. Kisanduku cha siku saba kinachojazwa mara moja kwa wiki huonyesha papo hapo kama dozi ya leo imetumika. Chagua vyumba vikubwa kama vidonge ni vikubwa au vingi, vifuniko vinavyoonyesha ndani kwa wazee, na modeli yenye kufunga imara ili isimwagike mkobani. Jaza kutoka kwenye pakiti halisi ukiwa na maagizo ya daktari mbele yako, na hifadhi pakiti halisi kwa kuhakiki majina, nguvu na tarehe za kuisha muda. Afya inauza saizi mbalimbali kwa sababu kisanduku rahisi ni mojawapo ya zana zenye ufanisi zaidi wa kufuata dawa."],["Low-cost adherence tool with high attach rate and gift appeal for parents","Zana ya bei nafuu ya kufuata dawa inayonunuliwa sana pamoja na nyingine na kama zawadi kwa wazazi"]],"hd_med_ampm":[["Many chronic-disease medicines are split between morning and evening, and confusion about whether the evening dose was taken leads to missed or doubled doses. AM/PM organisers have two rows per day, often colour-coded, so each dose has its own compartment. Push-button models open with one press, which helps people with arthritis or weak grip, while a simple daily box is enough for a short trip. Store organisers away from heat and humidity, which can soften some tablets, and do not pre-fill more than a week ahead. Afya stocks AM/PM organisers because twice-daily dosing is the norm for heart and diabetes care.","Dawa nyingi za magonjwa sugu hugawanywa kati ya asubuhi na jioni, na kuchanganyikiwa kama dozi ya jioni imetumika husababisha kuruka au kurudia dozi. Visanduku vya asubuhi na jioni vina safu mbili kwa kila siku, mara nyingi kwa rangi tofauti, ili kila dozi iwe na chumba chake. Modeli za kubonyeza hufunguka kwa kubonyeza mara moja, jambo linalowasaidia wenye ugonjwa wa viungo au wasio na nguvu ya kushika, huku kisanduku rahisi cha siku kikitosha kwa safari fupi. Hifadhi visanduku mbali na joto na unyevu, ambavyo vinaweza kulainisha baadhi ya vidonge, na usijaze mapema zaidi ya wiki moja. Afya inauza visanduku hivi kwa sababu dozi za mara mbili kwa siku ndizo za kawaida katika matibabu ya moyo na kisukari."],["Adherence upgrade with premium push-button tier and strong elder-care appeal","Kuboresha ufuataji wa dawa kwa toleo la hadhi la kubonyeza na mvuto kwa utunzaji wa wazee"]],"hd_med_cut":[["Doctors often start or adjust blood-pressure, heart and diabetes medicines by prescribing half a tablet, and breaking tablets by hand or with a kitchen knife gives uneven doses. A pill cutter with a V-shaped holder and a covered stainless blade splits scored tablets cleanly and safely. Only cut tablets that are scored or that your pharmacist confirms can be split; extended-release, coated and capsule forms must not be cut. Store the second half in the cutter's compartment and take it at the next scheduled dose. Afya stocks pill cutters at the dispensing counter as an inexpensive safety tool.","Mara nyingi daktari huanza au hurekebisha dawa za shinikizo, moyo na kisukari kwa kuandika nusu kidonge, na kuvunja vidonge kwa mkono au kisu cha jikoni hutoa dozi zisizo sawa. Kikataji chenye kishikio cha umbo la V na wembe wa chuma cha pua uliofunikwa hugawanya vidonge vyenye mstari kwa usafi na usalama. Kata tu vidonge vyenye mstari wa kugawa au ambavyo mfamasia amethibitisha vinaweza kugawanywa; vidonge vya kutoa dawa taratibu, vilivyopakwa kinga na kapsuli havipaswi kukatwa. Hifadhi nusu ya pili kwenye chumba cha kikataji na uitumie kwenye dozi inayofuata kwa ratiba. Afya inauza vikataji vya vidonge kwenye kaunta ya dawa kama zana ya usalama ya bei nafuu."],["Small safety tool sold at the point of advice","Zana ndogo ya usalama inayouzwa pale ushauri unapotolewa"]],"hd_med_box":[["People with chronic conditions accumulate tablets, strips, lancets, a meter, a BP monitor and paperwork, and keeping them together reduces lost items and expired stock. A lidded plastic box with a handle and dividers keeps everything clean, dry and away from children when placed on a high shelf. Store in the coolest room, away from the kitchen and bathroom where heat and steam damage medicines and strips. Check expiry dates once a month when refilling the pill organiser, and return expired medicines to a pharmacy rather than throwing them in household waste. Afya stocks storage boxes as a practical organiser for the whole chronic-care routine.","Watu wenye magonjwa sugu hujilimbikizia vidonge, vipande vya kupimia, sindano ndogo, mashine ya sukari, mashine ya shinikizo na makaratasi, na kuviweka pamoja hupunguza vitu kupotea na dawa kuisha muda bila kugunduliwa. Sanduku la plastiki lenye mfuniko, mpini na vigawanyo huweka kila kitu safi, kikavu na mbali na watoto likiwekwa kwenye rafu ya juu. Hifadhi kwenye chumba chenye baridi zaidi, mbali na jikoni na bafuni ambapo joto na mvuke huharibu dawa na vipande vya kupimia. Kagua tarehe za kuisha muda mara moja kwa mwezi unapojaza kisanduku cha vidonge, na rudisha dawa zilizoisha muda kwenye famasi badala ya kuzitupa kwenye taka za nyumbani. Afya inauza masanduku haya kama mpangaji wa vitendo kwa utaratibu wote wa huduma za magonjwa sugu."],["Organising item that raises basket value and keeps supplies visible for reorder","Bidhaa ya kupanga inayoongeza thamani ya kikapu na kuweka vifaa wazi kwa kuagiza tena"]],"hd_kid_bottle":[["Fluid advice differs sharply between conditions: people with kidney stones or at risk of heat dehydration are told to drink more, while those on dialysis or with heart failure may be limited to about 1–1.5 litres a day. A bottle with clear volume markings turns that advice into something measurable: fill it each morning with the day's allowance or target and track how much is left. Choose a BPA-free bottle that is easy to clean and holds 750 ml–1 L. In Dar es Salaam's hot season, people on water tablets or SGLT2 inhibitors should discuss with their clinician how to avoid dehydration. Afya stocks measured bottles in the kidney-care bay as a simple daily tool.","Ushauri wa maji hutofautiana sana kati ya hali za kiafya: watu wenye mawe kwenye figo au walio hatarini kupungukiwa maji kwa joto huambiwa wanywe zaidi, huku wanaosafishwa damu au wenye moyo kushindwa kufanya kazi wakiweza kuwekewa kikomo cha takriban lita 1–1.5 kwa siku. Chupa yenye alama wazi za vipimo hugeuza ushauri huo kuwa kitu kinachopimika: ijaze kila asubuhi kwa kiasi cha siku au lengo na fuatilia kiasi kilichobaki. Chagua chupa isiyo na BPA, rahisi kusafisha na yenye ujazo wa ml 750 hadi lita 1. Katika msimu wa joto wa Dar es Salaam, wanaotumia dawa za kukojoa au dawa za aina ya SGLT2 wajadiliane na mtaalamu wa afya jinsi ya kuepuka kupungukiwa maji. Afya inauza chupa zenye vipimo kwenye sehemu ya utunzaji wa figo kama zana rahisi ya kila siku."],["Everyday accessory that turns kidney counselling into a sale","Kiambatanisho cha kila siku kinachogeuza ushauri wa figo kuwa mauzo"]],"hd_kid_jug":[["For people on a fluid limit, every drink counts, including tea, soup, uji, juice and the water used to take tablets. Measuring the household cups once with a marked jug shows how much each one holds, so a daily total can be kept on paper or a phone. A 1 L jug with clear printed markings in millilitres is enough; a smaller measuring cup helps with tea and uji. Spreading the allowance across the day and using small cups helps manage thirst, along with sugar-free gum and ice chips if the renal team agrees. Afya stocks inexpensive jugs and cups as part of practical kidney-care support.","Kwa watu waliowekewa kikomo cha maji, kila kinywaji kinahesabiwa, pamoja na chai, supu, uji, sharubati na maji ya kumeza vidonge. Kupima vikombe vya nyumbani mara moja kwa jagi lenye alama huonyesha kila kimoja kinabeba kiasi gani, ili jumla ya siku iandikwe kwenye karatasi au simu. Jagi la lita 1 lenye alama wazi za mililita linatosha; kikombe kidogo cha kupimia husaidia kwa chai na uji. Kugawa kiasi kilichoruhusiwa siku nzima na kutumia vikombe vidogo husaidia kudhibiti kiu, pamoja na bazoka isiyo na sukari na vipande vya barafu kama timu ya figo itakubali. Afya inauza majagi na vikombe vya bei nafuu kama sehemu ya msaada wa vitendo wa utunzaji wa figo."],["Low-cost practical tool that deepens trust with kidney patients and carers","Zana ya vitendo ya bei ndogo inayoimarisha uaminifu kwa wagonjwa wa figo na walezi"]]};window.dispatchEvent(new Event("afyatx"));